window.EXERCISES={"built":"2026-10-09 21:54","items":[{"id":"ex01_mnist_mlp","file":"ex01_mnist_mlp.py","meta":{"title":"第一个完整训练循环：全连接网络识别手写数字","level":"入门","dataset":"mnist","chapter":"ch06","minutes":"30","goal":"亲手写出 PyTorch 训练代码的固定环节：选设备 → 数据集 → DataLoader → 模型 → 损失与优化器 → 评估函数 → 训练循环（前向、损失、清梯度、反向传播、更新）→ 保存。","task":"用两层全连接网络在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 90% 以上。","names":"device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc","pass":"0.90"},"steps":[{"id":"device","n":1,"title":"导入库，选择计算设备","explain":"训练代码的第一件事：决定**在哪块硬件上算**。同一份代码要能在不同电脑上跑：\n\n- NVIDIA 显卡（例如 Windows 上的 RTX 3060）→ `cuda`\n- Apple 芯片（M1/M2/M3）的 GPU → `mps`\n- 都没有就用 `cpu`\n\n后面所有的模型和数据都要 `.to(device)` 放到同一个设备上，否则会报“张量不在同一设备”的错。","view":"# 导入 torch / torchvision，并从 labkit 导入 DATA_ROOT（本地数据集目录）和 log_epoch（记录每轮指标，实验室据此画曲线）\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\n# 依次检查 NVIDIA 显卡（cuda）、Apple 芯片 GPU（mps），都没有就用 CPU，结果存进变量 device\nif torch.⟦device_sel⟧.is_available():\n    device = torch.device(\"⟦device_sel⟧\")\nelif torch.backends.mps.is_available():\n    device = torch.device(\"mps\")\nelse:\n    device = torch.device(\"cpu\")\nprint(\"使用设备：\", device)","answer":"# 导入 torch / torchvision，并从 labkit 导入 DATA_ROOT（本地数据集目录）和 log_epoch（记录每轮指标，实验室据此画曲线）\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\n# 依次检查 NVIDIA 显卡（cuda）、Apple 芯片 GPU（mps），都没有就用 CPU，结果存进变量 device\nif torch.cuda.is_available():\n    device = torch.device(\"cuda\")\nelif torch.backends.mps.is_available():\n    device = torch.device(\"mps\")\nelse:\n    device = torch.device(\"cpu\")\nprint(\"使用设备：\", device)","checks":["assert isinstance(device, torch.device), \"device 应该是 torch.device(...) 创建的对象\""],"blanks":[{"id":"device_sel","mask":"cuda","hint":"NVIDIA 显卡在 PyTorch 里叫什么后端？","options":["cuda","gpu","nvidia","mps"],"accept":[],"why":"PyTorch 用 \"cuda\" 表示 NVIDIA GPU（你的 RTX 3060），用 \"mps\" 表示 Apple 芯片的 GPU（Metal Performance Shaders）。","lines":6}]},{"id":"dataset","n":2,"title":"读取数据集：transform + Dataset","explain":"`torchvision.datasets.MNIST` 是一个 **Dataset**：按下标取出 `(图片, 标签)`。\n\n- `transform` 决定每张图片取出来时怎么处理：`ToTensor()` 把 0–255 的图片变成 0–1 的浮点张量，形状 `(1, 28, 28)`；`Normalize(均值, 标准差)` 再做标准化，让训练更稳定。\n- 数据集已经预先下载到本地 `DATA_ROOT`，所以 `download=False`，不用联网。","view":"# 把图片转成张量，再用 MNIST 的均值 0.1307、标准差 0.3081 标准化\ntransform = transforms.Compose([\n    transforms.⟦totensor⟧(),\n    transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,)),\n])\n# 从本地目录读取训练集和测试集，不要联网下载\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root=DATA_ROOT, ⟦ds_train⟧, download=False, transform=transform)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root=DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=transform)","answer":"# 把图片转成张量，再用 MNIST 的均值 0.1307、标准差 0.3081 标准化\ntransform = transforms.Compose([\n    transforms.ToTensor(),\n    transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,)),\n])\n# 从本地目录读取训练集和测试集，不要联网下载\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root=DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=transform)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root=DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=transform)","checks":["assert len(train_set) == 60000 and len(test_set) == 10000, f\"训练集应有 60000 张、测试集 10000 张，实际 {len(train_set)} / {len(test_set)}\"","_x, _y = train_set[0]; assert tuple(_x.shape) == (1, 28, 28), f\"单张图片应是 (1, 28, 28) 的张量，实际 {getattr(_x, 'shape', type(_x))}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"totensor","mask":"ToTensor","hint":"把 PIL 图片转成 0–1 浮点张量的变换叫什么？","options":["ToTensor","PILToTensor","Resize","Grayscale"],"accept":[],"why":"ToTensor 会把像素值除以 255 并把维度排成 (C, H, W)；PILToTensor 不会缩放到 0–1。","lines":4},{"id":"ds_train","mask":"train=True","hint":"用哪个参数区分训练集和测试集？","options":["train=True","split=\"train\"","training=True"],"accept":["train = True"],"why":"torchvision 的 MNIST 用 train=True/False 选择训练集（6 万张）或测试集（1 万张）。","lines":1}]},{"id":"loader","n":3,"title":"用 DataLoader 分批、打乱","explain":"一次把 6 万张图都塞进模型既慢又占内存，所以按**小批量（mini-batch）**训练。`DataLoader` 负责：\n\n- 按 `batch_size` 把样本拼成一批，形状变成 `(B, 1, 28, 28)`\n- `shuffle=True`：每一轮都打乱顺序，避免模型记住样本顺序\n\n测试集不需要打乱。\n\n> 在 Windows 上如果要设置 `num_workers>0`，脚本必须放在 `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` 里；这里用默认的 0 就不会有问题。","view":"# 训练集每批 128 张并打乱；测试集每批 1000 张、不打乱\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, ⟦shuffle⟧)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)","answer":"# 训练集每批 128 张并打乱；测试集每批 1000 张、不打乱\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)","checks":["_xb, _yb = next(iter(train_loader)); assert tuple(_xb.shape) == (128, 1, 28, 28), f\"一批训练图片应是 (128, 1, 28, 28)，实际 {tuple(_xb.shape)}\"","import torch.utils.data as _tud; assert isinstance(train_loader.sampler, _tud.RandomSampler), \"训练集的 DataLoader 需要打乱（shuffle=True）\""],"blanks":[{"id":"shuffle","mask":"shuffle=True","hint":"训练时每一轮都应该打乱样本顺序吗？","options":["shuffle=True","shuffle=False","drop_last=True"],"accept":["shuffle = True"],"why":"打乱让每个小批量都接近整体分布，梯度更“诚实”；不打乱时模型可能先学完所有 0 再学 1，训练会很不稳定。","lines":1}]},{"id":"model","n":4,"title":"定义模型：继承 nn.Module","explain":"PyTorch 的模型都继承 `nn.Module`，固定写两件事：\n\n1. `__init__` 里**创建层**（层里有可学习的参数）\n2. `forward` 里**写数据怎么流过这些层**（前向传播）\n\n全连接层 `nn.Linear(输入数, 输出数)` 只接受“拉平”的向量，所以要先把 `(B, 1, 28, 28)` 变成 `(B, 784)`。","view":"class MLP(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 输入 28×28=784 个像素 → 256 个隐藏单元 → 10 个类别\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(⟦fc1⟧, 256)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(256, ⟦fc2⟧)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 把 (B, 1, 28, 28) 拉平成 (B, 784)，再依次经过 fc1 → ReLU → fc2\n        x = torch.⟦flatten⟧(x, 1)\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        return self.fc2(x)\n\n\n# 创建模型并放到 device 上\nmodel = MLP()⟦model_to⟧\nprint(model)","answer":"class MLP(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 输入 28×28=784 个像素 → 256 个隐藏单元 → 10 个类别\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(784, 256)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(256, 10)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 把 (B, 1, 28, 28) 拉平成 (B, 784)，再依次经过 fc1 → ReLU → fc2\n        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        return self.fc2(x)\n\n\n# 创建模型并放到 device 上\nmodel = MLP().to(device)\nprint(model)","checks":["_out = model(torch.zeros(4, 1, 28, 28, device=device)); assert tuple(_out.shape) == (4, 10), f\"模型输出应是 (4, 10)，实际 {tuple(_out.shape)}\"","assert next(model.parameters()).device.type == device.type, \"模型参数不在 device 上，忘了 .to(device)？\""],"blanks":[{"id":"fc1","mask":"784","hint":"一张 28×28 的图片拉平以后有多少个数？","options":["784","28","256","1"],"accept":["28*28","28 * 28"],"why":"28 × 28 = 784，拉平后的每个像素都是一个输入特征。","lines":1},{"id":"fc2","mask":"10","hint":"MNIST 有几个类别？","options":["10","1","784","9"],"accept":[],"why":"数字 0–9 共 10 类，最后一层输出 10 个分数（logits），分数最大的就是预测结果。","lines":1},{"id":"flatten","mask":"flatten","hint":"哪个函数把多维张量“压扁”？第二个参数 1 表示保留第 0 维（批大小）","options":["flatten","reshape","squeeze","view_as"],"accept":["flatten"],"why":"torch.flatten(x, 1) 保留批维度，把其余维度合成一维；squeeze 只会去掉长度为 1 的维度。","lines":1},{"id":"model_to","mask":".to(device)","hint":"模型的参数默认在 CPU 上，怎么搬到 GPU？","options":[".to(device)",".cuda()",".device()",".gpu()"],"accept":[],"why":".to(device) 对 cuda / mps / cpu 都适用；.cuda() 只能用于 NVIDIA 显卡，在 Mac 上会报错。","lines":1}]},{"id":"optim","n":5,"title":"损失函数、优化器与超参数","explain":"- **损失函数**衡量预测有多差。多分类用交叉熵 `nn.CrossEntropyLoss`，它的输入是**未经 softmax 的分数**（logits）和类别下标。\n- **优化器**根据梯度更新参数，要告诉它“更新谁”——`model.parameters()`——以及学习率 `lr`。\n- `EPOCHS`：把训练集完整看几遍。","view":"# 多分类用交叉熵损失\ncriterion = nn.⟦criterion⟧()\n# 用带动量的 SGD 更新模型的全部参数，学习率 0.1\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(⟦opt_params⟧, lr=0.1, momentum=0.9)\nEPOCHS = 3","answer":"# 多分类用交叉熵损失\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n# 用带动量的 SGD 更新模型的全部参数，学习率 0.1\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=0.1, momentum=0.9)\nEPOCHS = 3","checks":["assert isinstance(criterion, nn.CrossEntropyLoss), \"损失函数应该是 nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\"","assert len(optimizer.param_groups[0][\"params\"]) == len(list(model.parameters())), \"优化器里应该包含模型的全部参数\""],"blanks":[{"id":"criterion","mask":"CrossEntropyLoss","hint":"多分类问题的标准损失函数","options":["CrossEntropyLoss","MSELoss","BCELoss","L1Loss"],"accept":[],"why":"CrossEntropyLoss 内部先做 log-softmax 再算负对数似然，适合多分类；MSELoss 用于回归。","lines":1},{"id":"opt_params","mask":"model.parameters()","hint":"优化器需要知道要更新哪些张量","options":["model.parameters()","model","model.state_dict()","model.forward"],"accept":[],"why":"model.parameters() 返回所有可学习参数（这里是两层的权重和偏置共 4 个张量）。","lines":1}]},{"id":"evaluate","n":6,"title":"评估函数：关掉梯度，切到评估模式","explain":"评估时不需要反向传播，所以：\n\n- `@torch.no_grad()`：不记录计算图，更快、更省内存\n- `model.eval()`：切到评估模式（Dropout、BatchNorm 在训练和评估时行为不同，这个模型虽然没有，但养成习惯）\n\n预测类别 = 分数最大的那一类：`logits.argmax(1)`。","view":"@torch.⟦nograd⟧()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    model.⟦eval_mode⟧()\n    loss_sum, correct, total = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss_sum += criterion(logits, yb).item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.⟦argmax⟧ == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return loss_sum / total, correct / total","answer":"@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    model.eval()\n    loss_sum, correct, total = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss_sum += criterion(logits, yb).item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return loss_sum / total, correct / total","checks":["_l, _a = evaluate(test_loader); assert 0.0 <= _a <= 1.0, f\"准确率应在 0–1 之间，实际 {_a}\"","assert not model.training, \"evaluate() 里需要调用 model.eval()\""],"blanks":[{"id":"nograd","mask":"no_grad","hint":"评估时不需要梯度，用哪个装饰器关掉？","options":["no_grad","enable_grad","inference","grad"],"accept":[],"why":"no_grad 让这段代码不构建计算图；enable_grad 恰好相反。","lines":1},{"id":"eval_mode","mask":"eval","hint":"切换到评估模式的方法","options":["eval","train","test","predict"],"accept":[],"why":"model.eval() 切到评估模式；训练时要再调用 model.train() 切回来。","lines":1},{"id":"argmax","mask":"argmax(1)","hint":"每一行 10 个分数里，取最大值的“位置”作为预测类别","options":["argmax(1)","max(1)","argmax(0)","softmax(1)"],"accept":[],"why":"argmax(1) 在类别维度（第 1 维）上找最大值的下标；argmax(0) 会在批维度上找，结果是错的。","lines":1}]},{"id":"train","n":7,"title":"训练循环：前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新","explain":"这是所有训练代码里**最核心、永远不变**的五步，每个小批量都要做一遍：\n\n1. **前向传播**：`logits = model(xb)`\n2. **计算损失**：`loss = criterion(logits, yb)`\n3. **清空梯度**：`optimizer.zero_grad()`——PyTorch 的梯度默认会**累加**，不清空就会把上一批的梯度也算进来\n4. **反向传播**：`loss.backward()`——用链式法则算出每个参数的梯度，存进 `参数.grad`\n5. **更新参数**：`optimizer.step()`——按梯度和学习率修改参数\n\n每轮开始调用 `model.train()`（因为评估函数切到了 eval 模式）。每轮结束评估一次，并用 `log_epoch` 记录指标，这样实验室页面就能画出曲线。","view":"for epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.⟦train_mode⟧\n    t0 = time.time()\n    loss_sum, correct, seen = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb⟦to_dev⟧, yb⟦to_dev⟧\n        # ① 前向传播  ② 计算损失\n        logits = ⟦forward⟧\n        loss = ⟦loss⟧\n        # ③ 清空上一步的梯度  ④ 反向传播  ⑤ 更新参数\n        optimizer.⟦zero_grad⟧()\n        loss.⟦backward⟧()\n        optimizer.⟦step⟧()\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        seen += len(yb)\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_loss, test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练损失 {loss_sum / seen:.4f}  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_loss=test_loss, test_acc=test_acc,\n              epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)","answer":"for epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0 = time.time()\n    loss_sum, correct, seen = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        # ① 前向传播  ② 计算损失\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        # ③ 清空上一步的梯度  ④ 反向传播  ⑤ 更新参数\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        seen += len(yb)\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_loss, test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练损失 {loss_sum / seen:.4f}  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_loss=test_loss, test_acc=test_acc,\n              epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)","checks":["assert test_acc > 0.8, f\"训练后测试准确率只有 {test_acc:.2%}，正常应该超过 80%。检查五步顺序和 zero_grad/backward/step 是否写对\""],"blanks":[{"id":"train_mode","mask":"train()","hint":"评估后要切回哪种模式？","options":["train()","eval()","training()","fit()"],"accept":[],"why":"evaluate() 把模型切到了 eval 模式，每轮训练前要用 model.train() 切回来。","lines":1},{"id":"to_dev","mask":".to(device)","hint":"数据也要和模型在同一个设备上","options":[".to(device)",".cuda()",".cpu()",".float()"],"accept":[],"why":"数据和模型必须在同一设备，否则报 “Expected all tensors to be on the same device”。","lines":1},{"id":"forward","mask":"model(xb)","hint":"把这一批图片送进模型，得到每类的分数","options":["model(xb)","model.forward","model.predict(xb)","model.parameters()"],"accept":["model.forward(xb)"],"why":"直接调用 model(xb) 会执行 forward（并触发钩子），这是推荐写法。","lines":1},{"id":"loss","mask":"criterion(logits, yb)","hint":"损失函数的两个参数：模型输出、真实标签","options":["criterion(logits, yb)","criterion(yb, logits)","criterion(logits)","criterion(xb, yb)"],"accept":[],"why":"CrossEntropyLoss(输入, 目标)：第一个是 logits，第二个是类别下标，顺序不能反。","lines":1},{"id":"zero_grad","mask":"zero_grad","hint":"梯度会累加，每步开始前要做什么？","options":["zero_grad","step","backward","reset"],"accept":[],"why":"不清空的话，这一步的梯度 = 本批梯度 + 之前所有批的梯度，更新方向就错了。","lines":1},{"id":"backward","mask":"backward","hint":"哪个调用会用链式法则计算所有参数的梯度？","options":["backward","step","grad","forward"],"accept":[],"why":"loss.backward() 从损失出发反向传播，把梯度存进每个参数的 .grad。","lines":1},{"id":"step","mask":"step","hint":"有了梯度之后，哪个调用真正修改参数？","options":["step","update","zero_grad","backward"],"accept":[],"why":"optimizer.step() 按 “参数 -= 学习率 × 梯度”（加上动量等）更新参数。","lines":1}]},{"id":"save","n":8,"title":"保存训练好的模型","explain":"训练好的参数存在 `model.state_dict()` 里（一个 “参数名 → 张量” 的字典）。保存它，以后可以加载回来直接预测，不用重新训练：\n\n```python\nmodel = MLP().to(device)\nmodel.load_state_dict(torch.load(\"mnist_mlp.pt\"))\n```","view":"torch.save(model.⟦save_sd⟧, \"mnist_mlp.pt\")\nprint(\"模型已保存到 mnist_mlp.pt\")","answer":"torch.save(model.state_dict(), \"mnist_mlp.pt\")\nprint(\"模型已保存到 mnist_mlp.pt\")","checks":["import os as _o; assert _o.path.exists(\"mnist_mlp.pt\"), \"没有找到保存的 mnist_mlp.pt\"","_sd = torch.load(\"mnist_mlp.pt\"); assert \"fc1.weight\" in _sd, \"保存的应是 model.state_dict()\""],"blanks":[{"id":"save_sd","mask":"state_dict()","hint":"保存的是参数字典，而不是整个模型对象","options":["state_dict()","parameters()","modules()","eval()"],"accept":[],"why":"推荐保存 state_dict：只含参数，文件小、跨代码版本更稳；直接 torch.save(model) 会依赖类定义的位置。","lines":1}]}],"l3":"\"\"\"\n第一个完整训练循环：全连接网络识别手写数字\n\n任务：用两层全连接网络在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 90% 以上。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入库，选择计算设备 [device] =====================\n# TODO: 导入 torch / torchvision，并从 labkit 导入 DATA_ROOT（本地数据集目录）和 log_epoch（记录每轮指标，实验室据此画曲线）\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\n# TODO: 依次检查 NVIDIA 显卡（cuda）、Apple 芯片 GPU（mps），都没有就用 CPU，结果存进变量 device\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（device_sel）：NVIDIA 显卡在 PyTorch 里叫什么后端？\n\nprint(\"使用设备：\", device)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：读取数据集：transform + Dataset [dataset] =====================\n# TODO: 把图片转成张量，再用 MNIST 的均值 0.1307、标准差 0.3081 标准化\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（totensor）：把 PIL 图片转成 0–1 浮点张量的变换叫什么？\n\n# TODO: 从本地目录读取训练集和测试集，不要联网下载\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（ds_train）：用哪个参数区分训练集和测试集？\n\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root=DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=transform)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：用 DataLoader 分批、打乱 [loader] =====================\n# TODO: 训练集每批 128 张并打乱；测试集每批 1000 张、不打乱\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（shuffle）：训练时每一轮都应该打乱样本顺序吗？\n\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：定义模型：继承 nn.Module [model] =====================\nclass MLP(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # TODO: 输入 28×28=784 个像素 → 256 个隐藏单元 → 10 个类别\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（fc1）：一张 28×28 的图片拉平以后有多少个数？\n\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（fc2）：MNIST 有几个类别？\n\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # TODO: 把 (B, 1, 28, 28) 拉平成 (B, 784)，再依次经过 fc1 → ReLU → fc2\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（flatten）：哪个函数把多维张量“压扁”？第二个参数 1 表示保留第 0 维（批大小）\n        pass\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        return self.fc2(x)\n\n\n# TODO: 创建模型并放到 device 上\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（model_to）：模型的参数默认在 CPU 上，怎么搬到 GPU？\n\nprint(model)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：损失函数、优化器与超参数 [optim] =====================\n# TODO: 多分类用交叉熵损失\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（criterion）：多分类问题的标准损失函数\n\n# TODO: 用带动量的 SGD 更新模型的全部参数，学习率 0.1\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（opt_params）：优化器需要知道要更新哪些张量\n\nEPOCHS = 3\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：评估函数：关掉梯度，切到评估模式 [evaluate] =====================\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（nograd）：评估时不需要梯度，用哪个装饰器关掉？\n\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（eval_mode）：切换到评估模式的方法\n    pass\n    loss_sum, correct, total = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss_sum += criterion(logits, yb).item() * len(yb)\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（argmax）：每一行 10 个分数里，取最大值的“位置”作为预测类别\n\n        total += len(yb)\n    return loss_sum / total, correct / total\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：训练循环：前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新 [train] =====================\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（train_mode）：评估后要切回哪种模式？\n    pass\n    t0 = time.time()\n    loss_sum, correct, seen = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（to_dev）：数据也要和模型在同一个设备上\n        pass\n        # TODO: ① 前向传播  ② 计算损失\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（forward）：把这一批图片送进模型，得到每类的分数\n        pass\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（loss）：损失函数的两个参数：模型输出、真实标签\n        pass\n        # TODO: ③ 清空上一步的梯度  ④ 反向传播  ⑤ 更新参数\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（zero_grad）：梯度会累加，每步开始前要做什么？\n        pass\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（backward）：哪个调用会用链式法则计算所有参数的梯度？\n        pass\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（step）：有了梯度之后，哪个调用真正修改参数？\n        pass\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        seen += len(yb)\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_loss, test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练损失 {loss_sum / seen:.4f}  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_loss=test_loss, test_acc=test_acc,\n              epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：保存训练好的模型 [save] =====================\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（save_sd）：保存的是参数字典，而不是整个模型对象\n\nprint(\"模型已保存到 mnist_mlp.pt\")\n","l4":"\"\"\"\n第一个完整训练循环：全连接网络识别手写数字\n\n任务：用两层全连接网络在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 90% 以上。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入库，选择计算设备 [device] =====================\n# TODO: 导入 torch / torchvision，并从 labkit 导入 DATA_ROOT（本地数据集目录）和 log_epoch（记录每轮指标，实验室据此画曲线）\n# TODO: 依次检查 NVIDIA 显卡（cuda）、Apple 芯片 GPU（mps），都没有就用 CPU，结果存进变量 device\n#   提示：NVIDIA 显卡在 PyTorch 里叫什么后端？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：读取数据集：transform + Dataset [dataset] =====================\n# TODO: 把图片转成张量，再用 MNIST 的均值 0.1307、标准差 0.3081 标准化\n#   提示：把 PIL 图片转成 0–1 浮点张量的变换叫什么？\n# TODO: 从本地目录读取训练集和测试集，不要联网下载\n#   提示：用哪个参数区分训练集和测试集？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：用 DataLoader 分批、打乱 [loader] =====================\n# TODO: 训练集每批 128 张并打乱；测试集每批 1000 张、不打乱\n#   提示：训练时每一轮都应该打乱样本顺序吗？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：定义模型：继承 nn.Module [model] =====================\n# TODO: 输入 28×28=784 个像素 → 256 个隐藏单元 → 10 个类别\n#   提示：一张 28×28 的图片拉平以后有多少个数？\n#   提示：MNIST 有几个类别？\n# TODO: 把 (B, 1, 28, 28) 拉平成 (B, 784)，再依次经过 fc1 → ReLU → fc2\n#   提示：哪个函数把多维张量“压扁”？第二个参数 1 表示保留第 0 维（批大小）\n# TODO: 创建模型并放到 device 上\n#   提示：模型的参数默认在 CPU 上，怎么搬到 GPU？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：损失函数、优化器与超参数 [optim] =====================\n# TODO: 多分类用交叉熵损失\n#   提示：多分类问题的标准损失函数\n# TODO: 用带动量的 SGD 更新模型的全部参数，学习率 0.1\n#   提示：优化器需要知道要更新哪些张量\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：评估函数：关掉梯度，切到评估模式 [evaluate] =====================\n#   提示：评估时不需要梯度，用哪个装饰器关掉？\n#   提示：切换到评估模式的方法\n#   提示：每一行 10 个分数里，取最大值的“位置”作为预测类别\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：训练循环：前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新 [train] =====================\n#   提示：评估后要切回哪种模式？\n#   提示：数据也要和模型在同一个设备上\n# TODO: ① 前向传播  ② 计算损失\n#   提示：把这一批图片送进模型，得到每类的分数\n#   提示：损失函数的两个参数：模型输出、真实标签\n# TODO: ③ 清空上一步的梯度  ④ 反向传播  ⑤ 更新参数\n#   提示：梯度会累加，每步开始前要做什么？\n#   提示：哪个调用会用链式法则计算所有参数的梯度？\n#   提示：有了梯度之后，哪个调用真正修改参数？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：保存训练好的模型 [save] =====================\n#   提示：保存的是参数字典，而不是整个模型对象\n","answer":"\"\"\"\n第一个完整训练循环：全连接网络识别手写数字\n\n任务：用两层全连接网络在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 90% 以上。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入库，选择计算设备 [device] =====================\n# 导入 torch / torchvision，并从 labkit 导入 DATA_ROOT（本地数据集目录）和 log_epoch（记录每轮指标，实验室据此画曲线）\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\n# 依次检查 NVIDIA 显卡（cuda）、Apple 芯片 GPU（mps），都没有就用 CPU，结果存进变量 device\nif torch.cuda.is_available():\n    device = torch.device(\"cuda\")\nelif torch.backends.mps.is_available():\n    device = torch.device(\"mps\")\nelse:\n    device = torch.device(\"cpu\")\nprint(\"使用设备：\", device)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：读取数据集：transform + Dataset [dataset] =====================\n# 把图片转成张量，再用 MNIST 的均值 0.1307、标准差 0.3081 标准化\ntransform = transforms.Compose([\n    transforms.ToTensor(),\n    transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,)),\n])\n# 从本地目录读取训练集和测试集，不要联网下载\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root=DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=transform)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(root=DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=transform)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：用 DataLoader 分批、打乱 [loader] =====================\n# 训练集每批 128 张并打乱；测试集每批 1000 张、不打乱\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：定义模型：继承 nn.Module [model] =====================\nclass MLP(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 输入 28×28=784 个像素 → 256 个隐藏单元 → 10 个类别\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(784, 256)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(256, 10)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 把 (B, 1, 28, 28) 拉平成 (B, 784)，再依次经过 fc1 → ReLU → fc2\n        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        return self.fc2(x)\n\n\n# 创建模型并放到 device 上\nmodel = MLP().to(device)\nprint(model)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：损失函数、优化器与超参数 [optim] =====================\n# 多分类用交叉熵损失\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n# 用带动量的 SGD 更新模型的全部参数，学习率 0.1\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=0.1, momentum=0.9)\nEPOCHS = 3\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：评估函数：关掉梯度，切到评估模式 [evaluate] =====================\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    model.eval()\n    loss_sum, correct, total = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss_sum += criterion(logits, yb).item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return loss_sum / total, correct / total\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：训练循环：前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新 [train] =====================\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0 = time.time()\n    loss_sum, correct, seen = 0.0, 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        # ① 前向传播  ② 计算损失\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        # ③ 清空上一步的梯度  ④ 反向传播  ⑤ 更新参数\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        seen += len(yb)\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_loss, test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练损失 {loss_sum / seen:.4f}  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_loss=test_loss, test_acc=test_acc,\n              epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：保存训练好的模型 [save] =====================\ntorch.save(model.state_dict(), \"mnist_mlp.pt\")\nprint(\"模型已保存到 mnist_mlp.pt\")\n"},{"id":"ex02_conv_shapes","file":"ex02_conv_shapes.py","meta":{"title":"卷积层与池化：把每一层的形状算清楚","level":"入门","dataset":"无（随机张量）","chapter":"ch08","minutes":"25","goal":"搭 CNN 最常见的错误是“形状对不上”。这一篇只做一件事：亲手创建卷积层、池化层，推算每一层输出的形状和参数量，最后接上全连接分类头。","task":"从一批 (8, 3, 32, 32) 的图片出发，搭出“卷积 → 下采样 → 池化 → 全连接”的小网络，输出 (8, 10)。","names":"x, conv, out_size, down, pool, n_params, features, n_flat, model"},"steps":[{"id":"input","n":1,"title":"图片张量的形状：NCHW","explain":"PyTorch 里一批图片是 4 维张量，顺序固定为 **N × C × H × W**：\n\n- N：一批有几张图（batch size）\n- C：通道数（彩色图 RGB 是 3，灰度图是 1）\n- H、W：高和宽\n\nTensorFlow/Keras 默认是 N × H × W × C，从网上抄代码时要特别注意。","view":"import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n# 造一批 8 张、3 通道、32×32 的随机“图片”\nx = torch.randn(⟦nchw⟧)\nprint(\"输入形状：\", tuple(x.shape))","answer":"import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n# 造一批 8 张、3 通道、32×32 的随机“图片”\nx = torch.randn(8, 3, 32, 32)\nprint(\"输入形状：\", tuple(x.shape))","checks":["assert tuple(x.shape) == (8, 3, 32, 32), f\"x 应该是 (8, 3, 32, 32)，实际 {tuple(x.shape)}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"nchw","mask":"8, 3, 32, 32","hint":"顺序是 批大小、通道、高、宽","options":["8, 3, 32, 32","8, 32, 32, 3","3, 32, 32, 8","32, 32, 3, 8"],"accept":[],"why":"PyTorch 用 NCHW：批大小在最前，通道紧跟其后。8, 32, 32, 3 是 TensorFlow 的 NHWC 顺序。","lines":1}]},{"id":"conv","n":2,"title":"创建卷积层：输入通道、输出通道、卷积核、填充","explain":"`nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, stride=1, padding=0)`：\n\n- `in_channels` 必须等于输入的通道数 C\n- `out_channels` 是卷积核的个数，也就是输出有几张特征图\n- 3×3 卷积核在边上会“吃掉”一圈像素；四周补 1 圈 0（`padding=1`）就能让输出的高宽不变","view":"# 3 个输入通道 → 16 个输出通道，3×3 卷积核，输出高宽保持 32×32\nconv = nn.Conv2d(\n    ⟦conv_in⟧,\n    out_channels=16,\n    kernel_size=3,\n    ⟦conv_pad⟧,\n)\ny = conv(x)\nprint(\"卷积后：\", tuple(y.shape))","answer":"# 3 个输入通道 → 16 个输出通道，3×3 卷积核，输出高宽保持 32×32\nconv = nn.Conv2d(\n    in_channels=3,\n    out_channels=16,\n    kernel_size=3,\n    padding=1,\n)\ny = conv(x)\nprint(\"卷积后：\", tuple(y.shape))","checks":["_y = conv(x); assert tuple(_y.shape) == (8, 16, 32, 32), f\"卷积输出应是 (8, 16, 32, 32)，实际 {tuple(_y.shape)}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"conv_in","mask":"in_channels=3","hint":"卷积层的输入通道数要和图片的哪个维度一致？","options":["in_channels=3","in_channels=32","in_channels=8","in_channels=1"],"accept":["in_channels = 3"],"why":"in_channels 要等于输入张量的 C=3（RGB）；写错会报 “expected input to have 1 channels, but got 3”。","lines":1},{"id":"conv_pad","mask":"padding=1","hint":"3×3 的核要让输出和输入一样大，四周要补几圈？","options":["padding=1","padding=0","padding=2","padding=3"],"accept":["padding = 1"],"why":"输出尺寸 = (32 + 2×1 − 3) / 1 + 1 = 32。通用规律：k×k 的核配 padding=(k−1)/2 就能保持尺寸。","lines":1}]},{"id":"formula","n":3,"title":"输出尺寸公式","explain":"每一层的输出高宽都可以用同一个公式算：\n\n$$o = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{n + 2p - k}{s} \\right\\rfloor + 1$$\n\nn 是输入尺寸，k 是卷积核大小，s 是步长，p 是填充。池化层也用同一个公式。把它写成函数，以后搭网络前先算一遍。","view":"# 实现输出尺寸公式；Python 里向下取整的整数除法是 //\ndef out_size(n, k, s=1, p=0):\n    return ⟦formula_expr⟧\n\n\nprint(\"32×32，3×3 核，填充 1：\", out_size(32, 3, 1, 1))","answer":"# 实现输出尺寸公式；Python 里向下取整的整数除法是 //\ndef out_size(n, k, s=1, p=0):\n    return (n + 2 * p - k) // s + 1\n\n\nprint(\"32×32，3×3 核，填充 1：\", out_size(32, 3, 1, 1))","checks":["assert out_size(32, 3, 1, 1) == 32, f\"out_size(32, 3, 1, 1) 应为 32，实际 {out_size(32, 3, 1, 1)}\"","assert out_size(28, 5) == 24 and out_size(32, 3, 2, 1) == 16 and out_size(7, 3, 2) == 3, \"out_size 的公式不对：试试 (n + 2p − k) // s + 1\""],"blanks":[{"id":"formula_expr","mask":"(n + 2 * p - k) // s + 1","hint":"先加两边的填充，再减去核大小，除以步长，最后加 1","options":["(n + 2 * p - k) // s + 1","(n - k) // s + 1","(n + p - k) // s + 1","(n + 2 * p - k) / s"],"accept":["(n+2*p-k)//s+1","(n - k + 2 * p) // s + 1"],"why":"两边各补 p 圈，所以是 2p；结果要向下取整再加 1。","lines":1}]},{"id":"stride","n":4,"title":"用步长 2 的卷积做下采样","explain":"想让特征图变小（下采样），可以用池化，也可以直接让卷积的步长 `stride=2`：每隔一个像素算一次，高宽减半。ResNet 就是这样下采样的。","view":"# 16 → 32 个通道，3×3 核，填充 1，并让高宽从 32 变成 16\ndown = nn.Conv2d(16, 32, kernel_size=3, ⟦stride2⟧, padding=1)\nprint(\"下采样后：\", tuple(down(conv(x)).shape))","answer":"# 16 → 32 个通道，3×3 核，填充 1，并让高宽从 32 变成 16\ndown = nn.Conv2d(16, 32, kernel_size=3, stride=2, padding=1)\nprint(\"下采样后：\", tuple(down(conv(x)).shape))","checks":["_z = down(conv(x)); assert tuple(_z.shape) == (8, 32, 16, 16), f\"下采样后应是 (8, 32, 16, 16)，实际 {tuple(_z.shape)}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"stride2","mask":"stride=2","hint":"每次滑动跨几个像素，高宽就会变成原来的一半？","options":["stride=2","stride=1","stride=4","dilation=2"],"accept":["stride = 2"],"why":"(32 + 2 − 3) // 2 + 1 = 16。dilation=2 是空洞卷积，扩大感受野但不缩小尺寸。","lines":1}]},{"id":"pool","n":5,"title":"最大池化","explain":"池化没有可学习的参数，只是在每个窗口里做一次汇总：\n\n- **最大池化** `nn.MaxPool2d(2)`：取 2×2 窗口里的最大值，高宽减半，保留最明显的特征\n- 平均池化 `nn.AvgPool2d(2)`：取平均值\n\n`kernel_size=2` 时步长默认也是 2，所以窗口互不重叠。","view":"# 2×2 窗口、取最大值的池化层\npool = nn.⟦maxpool⟧(kernel_size=2)\ndemo = torch.arange(16.0).view(1, 1, 4, 4)\nprint(demo[0, 0], \"\\n→ 最大池化 →\\n\", pool(demo)[0, 0])","answer":"# 2×2 窗口、取最大值的池化层\npool = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2)\ndemo = torch.arange(16.0).view(1, 1, 4, 4)\nprint(demo[0, 0], \"\\n→ 最大池化 →\\n\", pool(demo)[0, 0])","checks":["_p = pool(torch.arange(16.0).view(1, 1, 4, 4))[0, 0]; assert _p.tolist() == [[5.0, 7.0], [13.0, 15.0]], f\"4×4 的 0..15 经过 2×2 最大池化应是 [[5, 7], [13, 15]]，实际 {_p.tolist()}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"maxpool","mask":"MaxPool2d","hint":"取窗口内最大值的池化层叫什么？","options":["MaxPool2d","AvgPool2d","AdaptiveAvgPool2d","Dropout2d"],"accept":[],"why":"MaxPool2d 取最大值；AvgPool2d 取平均值；AdaptiveAvgPool2d 直接把任意尺寸变成指定尺寸。","lines":1}]},{"id":"params","n":6,"title":"数一数参数量","explain":"卷积层的参数量和图片多大**无关**，只和通道数、核大小有关：\n\n$$\\text{参数量} = (k \\times k \\times C_{in} + 1) \\times C_{out}$$\n\n“+1” 是每个输出通道的偏置。`p.numel()` 返回一个张量里元素的个数，把所有参数加起来就是总参数量。","view":"# 把 conv 的所有参数张量的元素个数加起来\nn_params = sum(p.⟦numel⟧ for p in conv.parameters())\nprint(\"conv 的参数量：\", n_params, \"= (3×3×3 + 1) × 16\")","answer":"# 把 conv 的所有参数张量的元素个数加起来\nn_params = sum(p.numel() for p in conv.parameters())\nprint(\"conv 的参数量：\", n_params, \"= (3×3×3 + 1) × 16\")","checks":["assert n_params == (3 * 3 * 3 + 1) * 16, f\"conv 的参数量应为 (3×3×3+1)×16 = 448，实际 {n_params}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"numel","mask":"numel()","hint":"张量的哪个方法返回元素总数？","options":["numel()","size()","dim()","shape"],"accept":[],"why":"numel() = number of elements；size()/shape 返回的是各维长度，dim() 是维数。","lines":1}]},{"id":"head","n":7,"title":"接上全连接分类头","explain":"卷积部分输出的是 (N, C, H, W) 的特征图，分类头 `nn.Linear` 需要知道“拉平以后有多少个数”。手算容易错，最稳的办法是**用一张假图片跑一遍**，看输出有多少个元素。\n\n`nn.Flatten()` 把 (N, C, H, W) 变成 (N, C×H×W)，最后接 `nn.Linear(n_flat, 10)` 得到 10 类的分数。","view":"features = nn.Sequential(\n    nn.Conv2d(3, 16, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),     # 32 → 16\n    nn.Conv2d(16, 32, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),    # 16 → 8\n)\n# 用一张全 0 的假图片（1 张、3 通道、32×32）跑一遍 features，数出拉平后的长度\nn_flat = features(⟦dummy⟧).numel()\nmodel = nn.Sequential(features, nn.Flatten(), nn.Linear(n_flat, 10))\nprint(\"拉平长度：\", n_flat, \"  模型输出：\", tuple(model(x).shape))","answer":"features = nn.Sequential(\n    nn.Conv2d(3, 16, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),     # 32 → 16\n    nn.Conv2d(16, 32, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),    # 16 → 8\n)\n# 用一张全 0 的假图片（1 张、3 通道、32×32）跑一遍 features，数出拉平后的长度\nn_flat = features(torch.zeros(1, 3, 32, 32)).numel()\nmodel = nn.Sequential(features, nn.Flatten(), nn.Linear(n_flat, 10))\nprint(\"拉平长度：\", n_flat, \"  模型输出：\", tuple(model(x).shape))","checks":["assert n_flat == 32 * 8 * 8, f\"拉平后的长度应为 32×8×8 = 2048，实际 {n_flat}\"","assert tuple(model(x).shape) == (8, 10), f\"整个模型的输出应是 (8, 10)，实际 {tuple(model(x).shape)}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"dummy","mask":"torch.zeros(1, 3, 32, 32)","hint":"假图片的形状要和真实输入一样，只是批大小为 1","options":["torch.zeros(1, 3, 32, 32)","torch.zeros(3, 32, 32)","torch.zeros(1, 32, 32, 3)","torch.zeros(32, 32)"],"accept":["torch.zeros((1, 3, 32, 32))"],"why":"卷积层要求 4 维输入 (N, C, H, W)；少了批维度或通道顺序不对都会报错。","lines":1}]}],"l3":"\"\"\"\n卷积层与池化：把每一层的形状算清楚\n\n任务：从一批 (8, 3, 32, 32) 的图片出发，搭出“卷积 → 下采样 → 池化 → 全连接”的小网络，输出 (8, 10)。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：x, conv, out_size, down, pool, n_params, features, n_flat, model\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：图片张量的形状：NCHW [input] =====================\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n# TODO: 造一批 8 张、3 通道、32×32 的随机“图片”\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（nchw）：顺序是 批大小、通道、高、宽\n\nprint(\"输入形状：\", tuple(x.shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：创建卷积层：输入通道、输出通道、卷积核、填充 [conv] =====================\n# TODO: 3 个输入通道 → 16 个输出通道，3×3 卷积核，输出高宽保持 32×32\nconv = nn.Conv2d(\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（conv_in）：卷积层的输入通道数要和图片的哪个维度一致？\n\n    out_channels=16,\n    kernel_size=3,\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（conv_pad）：3×3 的核要让输出和输入一样大，四周要补几圈？\n\n)\ny = conv(x)\nprint(\"卷积后：\", tuple(y.shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：输出尺寸公式 [formula] =====================\n# TODO: 实现输出尺寸公式；Python 里向下取整的整数除法是 //\ndef out_size(n, k, s=1, p=0):\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（formula_expr）：先加两边的填充，再减去核大小，除以步长，最后加 1\n    pass\n\n\nprint(\"32×32，3×3 核，填充 1：\", out_size(32, 3, 1, 1))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：用步长 2 的卷积做下采样 [stride] =====================\n# TODO: 16 → 32 个通道，3×3 核，填充 1，并让高宽从 32 变成 16\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（stride2）：每次滑动跨几个像素，高宽就会变成原来的一半？\n\nprint(\"下采样后：\", tuple(down(conv(x)).shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：最大池化 [pool] =====================\n# TODO: 2×2 窗口、取最大值的池化层\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（maxpool）：取窗口内最大值的池化层叫什么？\n\ndemo = torch.arange(16.0).view(1, 1, 4, 4)\nprint(demo[0, 0], \"\\n→ 最大池化 →\\n\", pool(demo)[0, 0])\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：数一数参数量 [params] =====================\n# TODO: 把 conv 的所有参数张量的元素个数加起来\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（numel）：张量的哪个方法返回元素总数？\n\nprint(\"conv 的参数量：\", n_params, \"= (3×3×3 + 1) × 16\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：接上全连接分类头 [head] =====================\nfeatures = nn.Sequential(\n    nn.Conv2d(3, 16, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),     # 32 → 16\n    nn.Conv2d(16, 32, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),    # 16 → 8\n)\n# TODO: 用一张全 0 的假图片（1 张、3 通道、32×32）跑一遍 features，数出拉平后的长度\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（dummy）：假图片的形状要和真实输入一样，只是批大小为 1\n\nmodel = nn.Sequential(features, nn.Flatten(), nn.Linear(n_flat, 10))\nprint(\"拉平长度：\", n_flat, \"  模型输出：\", tuple(model(x).shape))\n","l4":"\"\"\"\n卷积层与池化：把每一层的形状算清楚\n\n任务：从一批 (8, 3, 32, 32) 的图片出发，搭出“卷积 → 下采样 → 池化 → 全连接”的小网络，输出 (8, 10)。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：x, conv, out_size, down, pool, n_params, features, n_flat, model\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：图片张量的形状：NCHW [input] =====================\n# TODO: 造一批 8 张、3 通道、32×32 的随机“图片”\n#   提示：顺序是 批大小、通道、高、宽\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：创建卷积层：输入通道、输出通道、卷积核、填充 [conv] =====================\n# TODO: 3 个输入通道 → 16 个输出通道，3×3 卷积核，输出高宽保持 32×32\n#   提示：卷积层的输入通道数要和图片的哪个维度一致？\n#   提示：3×3 的核要让输出和输入一样大，四周要补几圈？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：输出尺寸公式 [formula] =====================\n# TODO: 实现输出尺寸公式；Python 里向下取整的整数除法是 //\n#   提示：先加两边的填充，再减去核大小，除以步长，最后加 1\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：用步长 2 的卷积做下采样 [stride] =====================\n# TODO: 16 → 32 个通道，3×3 核，填充 1，并让高宽从 32 变成 16\n#   提示：每次滑动跨几个像素，高宽就会变成原来的一半？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：最大池化 [pool] =====================\n# TODO: 2×2 窗口、取最大值的池化层\n#   提示：取窗口内最大值的池化层叫什么？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：数一数参数量 [params] =====================\n# TODO: 把 conv 的所有参数张量的元素个数加起来\n#   提示：张量的哪个方法返回元素总数？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：接上全连接分类头 [head] =====================\n# TODO: 用一张全 0 的假图片（1 张、3 通道、32×32）跑一遍 features，数出拉平后的长度\n#   提示：假图片的形状要和真实输入一样，只是批大小为 1\n","answer":"\"\"\"\n卷积层与池化：把每一层的形状算清楚\n\n任务：从一批 (8, 3, 32, 32) 的图片出发，搭出“卷积 → 下采样 → 池化 → 全连接”的小网络，输出 (8, 10)。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：x, conv, out_size, down, pool, n_params, features, n_flat, model\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：图片张量的形状：NCHW [input] =====================\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n# 造一批 8 张、3 通道、32×32 的随机“图片”\nx = torch.randn(8, 3, 32, 32)\nprint(\"输入形状：\", tuple(x.shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：创建卷积层：输入通道、输出通道、卷积核、填充 [conv] =====================\n# 3 个输入通道 → 16 个输出通道，3×3 卷积核，输出高宽保持 32×32\nconv = nn.Conv2d(\n    in_channels=3,\n    out_channels=16,\n    kernel_size=3,\n    padding=1,\n)\ny = conv(x)\nprint(\"卷积后：\", tuple(y.shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：输出尺寸公式 [formula] =====================\n# 实现输出尺寸公式；Python 里向下取整的整数除法是 //\ndef out_size(n, k, s=1, p=0):\n    return (n + 2 * p - k) // s + 1\n\n\nprint(\"32×32，3×3 核，填充 1：\", out_size(32, 3, 1, 1))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：用步长 2 的卷积做下采样 [stride] =====================\n# 16 → 32 个通道，3×3 核，填充 1，并让高宽从 32 变成 16\ndown = nn.Conv2d(16, 32, kernel_size=3, stride=2, padding=1)\nprint(\"下采样后：\", tuple(down(conv(x)).shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：最大池化 [pool] =====================\n# 2×2 窗口、取最大值的池化层\npool = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2)\ndemo = torch.arange(16.0).view(1, 1, 4, 4)\nprint(demo[0, 0], \"\\n→ 最大池化 →\\n\", pool(demo)[0, 0])\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：数一数参数量 [params] =====================\n# 把 conv 的所有参数张量的元素个数加起来\nn_params = sum(p.numel() for p in conv.parameters())\nprint(\"conv 的参数量：\", n_params, \"= (3×3×3 + 1) × 16\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：接上全连接分类头 [head] =====================\nfeatures = nn.Sequential(\n    nn.Conv2d(3, 16, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),     # 32 → 16\n    nn.Conv2d(16, 32, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.MaxPool2d(2),    # 16 → 8\n)\n# 用一张全 0 的假图片（1 张、3 通道、32×32）跑一遍 features，数出拉平后的长度\nn_flat = features(torch.zeros(1, 3, 32, 32)).numel()\nmodel = nn.Sequential(features, nn.Flatten(), nn.Linear(n_flat, 10))\nprint(\"拉平长度：\", n_flat, \"  模型输出：\", tuple(model(x).shape))\n"},{"id":"ex03_lenet_mnist","file":"ex03_lenet_mnist.py","meta":{"title":"第一个卷积网络：LeNet-5 识别手写数字","level":"入门","dataset":"mnist","chapter":"ch08","minutes":"35","goal":"把第 1 篇的全连接网络换成卷积网络 LeNet-5：卷积 → 池化 → 卷积 → 池化 → 全连接。训练流程的五个固定动作再写一遍，直到不用想就能写出来。","task":"用 LeNet-5 在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 98% 左右。","names":"device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, LeNet, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc","pass":"0.97"},"steps":[{"id":"setup","n":1,"title":"导入、设备与数据","explain":"这一步和第 1 篇一样：选设备、定义 transform、读取本地的 MNIST。已经写过的部分直接给出，只留一个空复习一下。","view":"import time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntransform = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,))])\n# 读取本地训练集与测试集（不联网）\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(DATA_ROOT, train=True, ⟦download⟧, transform=transform)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(DATA_ROOT, train=False, ⟦download⟧, transform=transform)\nprint(\"设备：\", device, \"  训练样本：\", len(train_set))","answer":"import time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntransform = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,))])\n# 读取本地训练集与测试集（不联网）\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=transform)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=transform)\nprint(\"设备：\", device, \"  训练样本：\", len(train_set))","checks":["assert len(train_set) == 60000 and len(test_set) == 10000, \"训练集 60000、测试集 10000\""],"blanks":[{"id":"download","mask":"download=False","hint":"数据已经预先下载好了，这个参数应该设成什么？","options":["download=False","download=True","offline=True","cache=True"],"accept":["download = False"],"why":"download=False 只读本地文件；设为 True 时如果文件已存在也会先校验，没联网时可能报错。","lines":2}]},{"id":"loader","n":2,"title":"DataLoader","explain":"训练集打乱、测试集不打乱，这是固定写法。","view":"train_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, ⟦loader2⟧)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)","answer":"train_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)","checks":["import torch.utils.data as _tud; assert isinstance(train_loader.sampler, _tud.RandomSampler), \"训练集的 DataLoader 要 shuffle=True\""],"blanks":[{"id":"loader2","mask":"shuffle=True","hint":"训练集要不要打乱？","options":["shuffle=True","shuffle=False","sampler=None","drop_last=True"],"accept":["shuffle = True"],"why":"训练集每轮打乱顺序；测试集顺序不影响结果，不需要打乱。","lines":1}]},{"id":"model","n":3,"title":"LeNet-5 的结构","explain":"LeNet-5（1998）是最早成功的卷积网络，结构非常规整：\n\n| 层 | 输出形状 |\n|---|---|\n| 输入 | 1 × 28 × 28 |\n| 卷积 5×5，6 个核，填充 2 | 6 × 28 × 28 |\n| 最大池化 2×2 | 6 × 14 × 14 |\n| 卷积 5×5，16 个核 | 16 × 10 × 10 |\n| 最大池化 2×2 | 16 × 5 × 5 |\n| 全连接 → 120 → 84 → 10 | |\n\n第二个池化之后拉平，长度是 16 × 5 × 5 = 400，这就是第一个全连接层的输入大小。","view":"class LeNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 第一层卷积：MNIST 是灰度图，输入几个通道？\n        self.conv1 = ⟦lenet_in⟧, kernel_size=5, padding=2)\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(6, 16, kernel_size=5)\n        self.pool = nn.MaxPool2d(2)\n        # 拉平后的长度 = 16 个通道 × 5 × 5\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(⟦lenet_flat⟧, 120)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(120, 84)\n        self.fc3 = nn.Linear(84, 10)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 卷积 → ReLU → 池化，做两次\n        x = ⟦lenet_fwd⟧\n        x = self.pool(F.relu(self.conv2(x)))\n        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        x = F.relu(self.fc2(x))\n        return self.fc3(x)\n\n\nmodel = LeNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))","answer":"class LeNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 第一层卷积：MNIST 是灰度图，输入几个通道？\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(1, 6, kernel_size=5, padding=2)\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(6, 16, kernel_size=5)\n        self.pool = nn.MaxPool2d(2)\n        # 拉平后的长度 = 16 个通道 × 5 × 5\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(16 * 5 * 5, 120)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(120, 84)\n        self.fc3 = nn.Linear(84, 10)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 卷积 → ReLU → 池化，做两次\n        x = self.pool(F.relu(self.conv1(x)))\n        x = self.pool(F.relu(self.conv2(x)))\n        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        x = F.relu(self.fc2(x))\n        return self.fc3(x)\n\n\nmodel = LeNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))","checks":["_o = model(torch.zeros(2, 1, 28, 28, device=device)); assert tuple(_o.shape) == (2, 10), f\"LeNet 的输出应是 (2, 10)，实际 {tuple(_o.shape)}\"","assert sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()) == 61706, f\"LeNet-5 的参数量应为 61706，实际 {sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters())}；检查各层的通道数和全连接大小\""],"blanks":[{"id":"lenet_in","mask":"nn.Conv2d(1, 6","hint":"灰度图有几个通道？","options":["nn.Conv2d(1, 6","nn.Conv2d(3, 6","nn.Conv2d(6, 1","nn.Conv2d(28, 6"],"accept":[],"why":"灰度图只有 1 个通道；彩色图（CIFAR）才是 3。顺序是 (输入通道, 输出通道)。","lines":1},{"id":"lenet_flat","mask":"16 * 5 * 5","hint":"第二次池化后的形状是 16 × 5 × 5","options":["16 * 5 * 5","16 * 7 * 7","6 * 14 * 14","16 * 10 * 10"],"accept":["400","16*5*5"],"why":"28 →（卷积 5×5 填充 2）28 →（池化）14 →（卷积 5×5 不填充）10 →（池化）5，所以是 16×5×5 = 400。","lines":1},{"id":"lenet_fwd","mask":"self.pool(F.relu(self.conv1(x)))","hint":"由内向外：先卷积，再激活，最后池化","options":["self.pool(F.relu(self.conv1(x)))","F.relu(self.pool(self.conv1(x)))","self.conv1(self.pool(F.relu(x)))","self.pool(self.conv1(F.relu(x)))"],"accept":[],"why":"标准顺序是 卷积 → 激活 → 池化。先池化再卷积会丢掉一半分辨率。（对最大池化来说 ReLU 和池化交换顺序结果相同，但习惯写法是先激活。）","lines":1}]},{"id":"optim","n":4,"title":"损失与优化器","explain":"这次用 **Adam** 优化器：它为每个参数自动调整步长，对学习率没那么敏感，`lr=1e-3` 是最常用的起点。","view":"criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n# 用 Adam 优化模型全部参数，学习率 0.001\noptimizer = torch.optim.⟦adam⟧(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3)\nEPOCHS = 3","answer":"criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n# 用 Adam 优化模型全部参数，学习率 0.001\noptimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3)\nEPOCHS = 3","checks":["assert isinstance(optimizer, torch.optim.Adam), \"这里要用 torch.optim.Adam\""],"blanks":[{"id":"adam","mask":"Adam","hint":"自适应学习率、最常用的那个优化器","options":["Adam","SGD","Adagrad","LBFGS"],"accept":[],"why":"Adam 结合了动量和自适应学习率，收敛快、调参简单；SGD 不加动量时在这里会慢很多。","lines":1}]},{"id":"evaluate","n":5,"title":"评估函数","explain":"和第 1 篇一样：`@torch.no_grad()` + `model.eval()` + `argmax(1)`。","view":"@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    ⟦eval2⟧\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total","answer":"@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    model.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total","checks":["_a = evaluate(test_loader); assert 0.0 <= _a <= 1.0 and not model.training, \"evaluate() 应返回 0–1 的准确率，并调用 model.eval()\""],"blanks":[{"id":"eval2","mask":"model.eval()","hint":"评估前切换模式","options":["model.eval()","model.train()","model.test()","torch.eval()"],"accept":[],"why":"model.eval() 切到评估模式，Dropout/BatchNorm 会改用评估时的行为。","lines":1}]},{"id":"train","n":6,"title":"训练循环（五个固定动作）","explain":"不看第 1 篇，自己写出这五步：\n\n1. 前向：`logits = model(xb)`\n2. 损失：`loss = criterion(logits, yb)`\n3. 清梯度：`optimizer.zero_grad()`\n4. 反向：`loss.backward()`\n5. 更新：`optimizer.step()`","view":"for epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        # 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新参数（顺序很重要）\n        ⟦three⟧\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)","answer":"for epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        # 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新参数（顺序很重要）\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)","checks":["assert test_acc > 0.85, f\"测试准确率只有 {test_acc:.2%}，正常应超过 85%：检查训练循环的三个动作顺序\""],"blanks":[{"id":"three","mask":"optimizer.zero_grad()","hint":"三步里的第一步：先把上一批留下的梯度清掉","options":["optimizer.zero_grad()","optimizer.step()","loss.backward()","model.zero_grad"],"accept":["model.zero_grad()"],"why":"顺序固定为 zero_grad → backward → step。如果先 step 再 backward，这一步用的是上一批的梯度（甚至被清空的梯度）。","lines":3}]}],"l3":"\"\"\"\n第一个卷积网络：LeNet-5 识别手写数字\n\n任务：用 LeNet-5 在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 98% 左右。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, LeNet, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入、设备与数据 [setup] =====================\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntransform = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,))])\n# TODO: 读取本地训练集与测试集（不联网）\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（download）：数据已经预先下载好了，这个参数应该设成什么？\n\nprint(\"设备：\", device, \"  训练样本：\", len(train_set))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：DataLoader [loader] =====================\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（loader2）：训练集要不要打乱？\n\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：LeNet-5 的结构 [model] =====================\nclass LeNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # TODO: 第一层卷积：MNIST 是灰度图，输入几个通道？\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（lenet_in）：灰度图有几个通道？\n\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(6, 16, kernel_size=5)\n        self.pool = nn.MaxPool2d(2)\n        # TODO: 拉平后的长度 = 16 个通道 × 5 × 5\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（lenet_flat）：第二次池化后的形状是 16 × 5 × 5\n\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(120, 84)\n        self.fc3 = nn.Linear(84, 10)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # TODO: 卷积 → ReLU → 池化，做两次\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（lenet_fwd）：由内向外：先卷积，再激活，最后池化\n        pass\n        x = self.pool(F.relu(self.conv2(x)))\n        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        x = F.relu(self.fc2(x))\n        return self.fc3(x)\n\n\nmodel = LeNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：损失与优化器 [optim] =====================\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n# TODO: 用 Adam 优化模型全部参数，学习率 0.001\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（adam）：自适应学习率、最常用的那个优化器\n\nEPOCHS = 3\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：评估函数 [evaluate] =====================\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（eval2）：评估前切换模式\n    pass\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：训练循环（五个固定动作） [train] =====================\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        # TODO: 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新参数（顺序很重要）\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（three）：三步里的第一步：先把上一批留下的梯度清掉\n\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)\n","l4":"\"\"\"\n第一个卷积网络：LeNet-5 识别手写数字\n\n任务：用 LeNet-5 在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 98% 左右。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, LeNet, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入、设备与数据 [setup] =====================\n# TODO: 读取本地训练集与测试集（不联网）\n#   提示：数据已经预先下载好了，这个参数应该设成什么？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：DataLoader [loader] =====================\n#   提示：训练集要不要打乱？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：LeNet-5 的结构 [model] =====================\n# TODO: 第一层卷积：MNIST 是灰度图，输入几个通道？\n#   提示：灰度图有几个通道？\n# TODO: 拉平后的长度 = 16 个通道 × 5 × 5\n#   提示：第二次池化后的形状是 16 × 5 × 5\n# TODO: 卷积 → ReLU → 池化，做两次\n#   提示：由内向外：先卷积，再激活，最后池化\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：损失与优化器 [optim] =====================\n# TODO: 用 Adam 优化模型全部参数，学习率 0.001\n#   提示：自适应学习率、最常用的那个优化器\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：评估函数 [evaluate] =====================\n#   提示：评估前切换模式\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：训练循环（五个固定动作） [train] =====================\n# TODO: 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新参数（顺序很重要）\n#   提示：三步里的第一步：先把上一批留下的梯度清掉\n","answer":"\"\"\"\n第一个卷积网络：LeNet-5 识别手写数字\n\n任务：用 LeNet-5 在 MNIST 上训练，测试准确率达到 98% 左右。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, LeNet, model, criterion, optimizer, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入、设备与数据 [setup] =====================\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntransform = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,))])\n# 读取本地训练集与测试集（不联网）\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=transform)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=transform)\nprint(\"设备：\", device, \"  训练样本：\", len(train_set))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：DataLoader [loader] =====================\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=1000)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：LeNet-5 的结构 [model] =====================\nclass LeNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 第一层卷积：MNIST 是灰度图，输入几个通道？\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(1, 6, kernel_size=5, padding=2)\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(6, 16, kernel_size=5)\n        self.pool = nn.MaxPool2d(2)\n        # 拉平后的长度 = 16 个通道 × 5 × 5\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(16 * 5 * 5, 120)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(120, 84)\n        self.fc3 = nn.Linear(84, 10)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        # 卷积 → ReLU → 池化，做两次\n        x = self.pool(F.relu(self.conv1(x)))\n        x = self.pool(F.relu(self.conv2(x)))\n        x = torch.flatten(x, 1)\n        x = F.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        x = F.relu(self.fc2(x))\n        return self.fc3(x)\n\n\nmodel = LeNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：损失与优化器 [optim] =====================\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n# 用 Adam 优化模型全部参数，学习率 0.001\noptimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3)\nEPOCHS = 3\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：评估函数 [evaluate] =====================\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    model.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：训练循环（五个固定动作） [train] =====================\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        # 清梯度 → 反向传播 → 更新参数（顺序很重要）\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)\n"},{"id":"ex04_autograd_step","file":"ex04_autograd_step.py","meta":{"title":"拆开黑盒：手写反向传播之后的 step 与 zero_grad","level":"进阶","dataset":"无（自己生成的线性回归数据）","chapter":"ch04","minutes":"30","goal":"optimizer.step() 和 zero_grad() 到底做了什么？用最简单的线性回归，自己写出“梯度下降一步”，再证明它和 torch.optim.SGD 的结果一模一样。","task":"不用优化器，手写梯度下降把 w、b 学出来；再用 torch.optim.SGD 重做一遍，两者结果完全一致。","names":"X, y, true_w, w, b, loss, loss_before, lr, w2, b2, opt"},"steps":[{"id":"data","n":1,"title":"造一份已知答案的数据","explain":"先造数据：真实规律是 $y = 2x_1 - 3x_2 + 0.5x_3 + 1$，再加一点噪声。因为答案已知，训练完可以直接检查学得对不对。\n\n`X` 是 200×3 的矩阵（200 个样本、3 个特征），`X @ true_w` 是矩阵乘向量，得到 200 个预测值。","view":"import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nX = torch.randn(200, 3)\ntrue_w = torch.tensor([2.0, -3.0, 0.5])\n# 用矩阵乘法算出每个样本的真实值，再加上截距 1 和少量噪声\ny = ⟦matmul⟧ + 1.0 + 0.1 * torch.randn(200)\nprint(\"X:\", tuple(X.shape), \" y:\", tuple(y.shape))","answer":"import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nX = torch.randn(200, 3)\ntrue_w = torch.tensor([2.0, -3.0, 0.5])\n# 用矩阵乘法算出每个样本的真实值，再加上截距 1 和少量噪声\ny = X @ true_w + 1.0 + 0.1 * torch.randn(200)\nprint(\"X:\", tuple(X.shape), \" y:\", tuple(y.shape))","checks":["assert tuple(y.shape) == (200,), f\"y 应该是长度 200 的向量，实际 {tuple(y.shape)}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"matmul","mask":"X @ true_w","hint":"200×3 的矩阵乘以长度 3 的向量，用哪个运算符？","options":["X @ true_w","X * true_w","true_w @ X","X + true_w"],"accept":["X.matmul(true_w)","torch.matmul(X, true_w)"],"why":"@ 是矩阵乘法，结果形状 (200,)；X * true_w 是逐元素相乘（广播），结果是 (200, 3)。","lines":1}]},{"id":"params","n":2,"title":"要学习的参数：告诉 PyTorch 记录梯度","explain":"模型 $\\hat y = Xw + b$ 有两个参数 w（3 个数）和 b（1 个数）。创建时加上 `requires_grad=True`，PyTorch 才会记录用到它们的每一步运算，之后 `backward()` 才能算出它们的梯度。\n\nnn.Linear 里的权重默认就是这样创建的，这里我们手动做一遍。","view":"# w 初始化为 3 个 0，b 初始化为 1 个 0，都需要梯度\nw = torch.zeros(3, ⟦reqgrad⟧)\nb = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)","answer":"# w 初始化为 3 个 0，b 初始化为 1 个 0，都需要梯度\nw = torch.zeros(3, requires_grad=True)\nb = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)","checks":["assert w.requires_grad and b.requires_grad, \"w 和 b 都要 requires_grad=True\"","assert tuple(w.shape) == (3,) and tuple(b.shape) == (1,), \"w 应该有 3 个元素，b 有 1 个\""],"blanks":[{"id":"reqgrad","mask":"requires_grad=True","hint":"哪个参数让张量“需要梯度”？","options":["requires_grad=True","grad=True","requires_grad=False","autograd=True"],"accept":["requires_grad = True"],"why":"requires_grad=True 告诉 autograd 追踪这个张量；没有它，backward 之后 w.grad 是 None。","lines":1}]},{"id":"loss","n":3,"title":"前向传播与均方误差","explain":"前向传播：$\\hat y = Xw + b$。回归问题常用**均方误差**：\n\n$$L = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_i (\\hat y_i - y_i)^2$$\n\n结果必须是一个**标量**（0 维张量），因为 `backward()` 默认从一个标量出发求导。","view":"pred = X @ w + b\n# 预测值减真实值、平方、再取平均\nloss = ⟦mse⟧\nloss_before = loss.item()\nprint(\"初始损失：\", round(loss_before, 4))","answer":"pred = X @ w + b\n# 预测值减真实值、平方、再取平均\nloss = ((pred - y) ** 2).mean()\nloss_before = loss.item()\nprint(\"初始损失：\", round(loss_before, 4))","checks":["assert loss.dim() == 0, \"loss 应该是一个标量（0 维张量），记得最后取 mean()\"","assert abs(loss.item() - ((X @ w.detach() + b.detach() - y) ** 2).mean().item()) < 1e-5, \"loss 应该是均方误差 ((pred - y) ** 2).mean()\""],"blanks":[{"id":"mse","mask":"((pred - y) ** 2).mean()","hint":"先平方再平均，结果是一个数","options":["((pred - y) ** 2).mean()","(pred - y).mean()","(pred - y) ** 2","(pred - y).abs().sum()"],"accept":["((pred-y)**2).mean()","torch.mean((pred - y) ** 2)"],"why":"不平方的话正负误差会抵消；不取平均得到的是 200 个数，backward 需要标量。","lines":1}]},{"id":"backward","n":4,"title":"反向传播：梯度存到哪里了？","explain":"`loss.backward()` 沿着刚才记录的运算反向求导，把 $\\partial L / \\partial w$ 存进 **`w.grad`**（`b` 同理）。它只**计算**梯度，不会修改 w 本身。\n\n对均方误差，可以手算出梯度 $\\frac{2}{N}X^\\top(\\hat y - y)$，评测会用它来核对。","view":"# 从 loss 出发反向传播\nloss.⟦backward2⟧\nprint(\"w 的梯度：\", w.grad)","answer":"# 从 loss 出发反向传播\nloss.backward()\nprint(\"w 的梯度：\", w.grad)","checks":["assert w.grad is not None, \"w.grad 还是 None：忘了调用 loss.backward()？\"","_g = 2 * X.T @ (X @ w.detach() + b.detach() - y) / len(y); assert torch.allclose(w.grad, _g, atol=1e-5), \"w.grad 和手算的梯度 2/N·Xᵀ(ŷ−y) 不一致\""],"blanks":[{"id":"backward2","mask":"backward()","hint":"哪个方法从损失出发计算所有参数的梯度？","options":["backward()","grad()","step()","detach()"],"accept":[],"why":"backward() 计算梯度并累加到 .grad；detach() 是切断计算图，step() 是优化器的方法。","lines":1}]},{"id":"step","n":5,"title":"手写一步梯度下降，然后清空梯度","explain":"`optimizer.step()` 对普通 SGD 做的事就是：\n\n$$w \\leftarrow w - \\text{lr} \\times \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}$$\n\n两个要点：\n\n1. 更新要放在 `torch.no_grad()` 里——这一步只是改数值，**不能**被记进计算图\n2. 更新完要把梯度清零（`zero_grad()` 做的就是这个），因为 PyTorch 的梯度会**累加**","view":"lr = 0.1\n# 在不记录梯度的上下文里，沿负梯度方向更新 w 和 b\nwith torch.⟦nograd2⟧():\n    ⟦update⟧\n    b -= lr * b.grad\n# 把累加的梯度清零，为下一步做准备\nw.grad.⟦zero⟧\nb.grad.⟦zero⟧\nloss_after = ((X @ w + b - y) ** 2).mean().item()\nprint(f\"走了一步：损失 {loss_before:.4f} → {loss_after:.4f}\")","answer":"lr = 0.1\n# 在不记录梯度的上下文里，沿负梯度方向更新 w 和 b\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    w -= lr * w.grad\n    b -= lr * b.grad\n# 把累加的梯度清零，为下一步做准备\nw.grad.zero_()\nb.grad.zero_()\nloss_after = ((X @ w + b - y) ** 2).mean().item()\nprint(f\"走了一步：损失 {loss_before:.4f} → {loss_after:.4f}\")","checks":["assert ((X @ w.detach() + b.detach() - y) ** 2).mean().item() < loss_before, \"更新一步后损失应该变小：检查是不是减去了梯度\"","assert float(w.grad.abs().sum()) == 0.0 and float(b.grad.abs().sum()) == 0.0, \"更新后要把 w.grad 和 b.grad 清零\""],"blanks":[{"id":"nograd2","mask":"no_grad","hint":"修改参数本身的这一步不应该被 autograd 记录","options":["no_grad","enable_grad","inference_mode_off","set_grad_enabled(True)"],"accept":[],"why":"在 no_grad 外直接 w -= ... 会报错：“a leaf Variable that requires grad is being used in an in-place operation”。","lines":1},{"id":"update","mask":"w -= lr * w.grad","hint":"沿着梯度的反方向走一小步","options":["w -= lr * w.grad","w += lr * w.grad","w = lr * w.grad","w -= w.grad / lr"],"accept":["w-=lr*w.grad","w.sub_(lr * w.grad)"],"why":"梯度指向损失增大的方向，所以要减去；w = lr * w.grad 会把 w 整个替换掉，也就不再是参数了。","lines":1},{"id":"zero","mask":"zero_()","hint":"带下划线的方法表示“原地修改”，哪个把张量置零？","options":["zero_()","zero()","zeros()","clear()"],"accept":[],"why":"Tensor.zero_() 原地置零；optimizer.zero_grad() 内部做的就是对每个参数的 .grad 置零（或设为 None）。","lines":2}]},{"id":"loop","n":6,"title":"把这一步重复 100 次","explain":"训练就是把“前向 → 损失 → 反向 → 更新 → 清零”重复很多次。注意每一轮都要**重新做前向传播**，因为参数变了，预测也跟着变。","view":"for i in range(100):\n    pred = X @ w + b\n    loss = ((pred - y) ** 2).mean()\n    # 反向传播、更新、清零——和上一步完全一样\n    ⟦loop_bw⟧\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        w -= lr * w.grad\n        b -= lr * b.grad\n    w.grad.zero_()\n    b.grad.zero_()\nprint(\"学到的 w：\", w.detach().numpy().round(3), \" b：\", round(b.item(), 3), \"（真实值 [2, -3, 0.5] 和 1）\")","answer":"for i in range(100):\n    pred = X @ w + b\n    loss = ((pred - y) ** 2).mean()\n    # 反向传播、更新、清零——和上一步完全一样\n    loss.backward()\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        w -= lr * w.grad\n        b -= lr * b.grad\n    w.grad.zero_()\n    b.grad.zero_()\nprint(\"学到的 w：\", w.detach().numpy().round(3), \" b：\", round(b.item(), 3), \"（真实值 [2, -3, 0.5] 和 1）\")","checks":["assert torch.allclose(w.detach(), true_w, atol=0.1), f\"100 步后 w 应该接近 [2, -3, 0.5]，实际 {w.detach().tolist()}\"","assert abs(b.item() - 1.0) < 0.1, f\"b 应该接近 1，实际 {b.item():.3f}\""],"blanks":[{"id":"loop_bw","mask":"loss.backward()","hint":"每一轮先算出梯度","options":["loss.backward()","loss.step()","w.backward()","loss.grad()"],"accept":[],"why":"每一轮的损失都是新算出来的，要重新 backward 才有新的梯度。","lines":1}]},{"id":"optim","n":7,"title":"换成 torch.optim.SGD：结果完全一样","explain":"现在用 PyTorch 的优化器重做一遍。从同样的初值出发、同样的学习率、同样的步数，结果应该和手写版本**分毫不差**——这就证明了：\n\n- `optimizer.zero_grad()` = 把每个参数的 `.grad` 清零\n- `optimizer.step()` = 在 no_grad 下做 `参数 -= lr × 梯度`\n\n优化器要知道它负责哪些参数，所以创建时把参数列表传进去。","view":"w2 = torch.zeros(3, requires_grad=True)\nb2 = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)\n# 让 SGD 负责更新 w2 和 b2，学习率与手写版相同\nopt = torch.optim.SGD(⟦optlist⟧, lr=lr)\nfor i in range(101):          # 手写版本一共更新了 1 + 100 步\n    loss2 = ((X @ w2 + b2 - y) ** 2).mean()\n    opt.zero_grad()\n    loss2.backward()\n    opt.step()\nprint(\"手写:\", w.detach().numpy().round(5), \" SGD:\", w2.detach().numpy().round(5))","answer":"w2 = torch.zeros(3, requires_grad=True)\nb2 = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)\n# 让 SGD 负责更新 w2 和 b2，学习率与手写版相同\nopt = torch.optim.SGD([w2, b2], lr=lr)\nfor i in range(101):          # 手写版本一共更新了 1 + 100 步\n    loss2 = ((X @ w2 + b2 - y) ** 2).mean()\n    opt.zero_grad()\n    loss2.backward()\n    opt.step()\nprint(\"手写:\", w.detach().numpy().round(5), \" SGD:\", w2.detach().numpy().round(5))","checks":["assert torch.allclose(w2.detach(), w.detach(), atol=1e-5) and torch.allclose(b2.detach(), b.detach(), atol=1e-5), \"torch.optim.SGD 的结果应该和手写版本完全一致\""],"blanks":[{"id":"optlist","mask":"[w2, b2]","hint":"优化器的第一个参数是“要更新的张量”组成的列表","options":["[w2, b2]","w2, b2","[w2.grad, b2.grad]","[w, b]"],"accept":["(w2, b2)"],"why":"SGD 接收一个可迭代的参数集合；传 w、b 会去更新已经训练好的那组参数。","lines":1}]}],"l3":"\"\"\"\n拆开黑盒：手写反向传播之后的 step 与 zero_grad\n\n任务：不用优化器，手写梯度下降把 w、b 学出来；再用 torch.optim.SGD 重做一遍，两者结果完全一致。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：X, y, true_w, w, b, loss, loss_before, lr, w2, b2, opt\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：造一份已知答案的数据 [data] =====================\nimport torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nX = torch.randn(200, 3)\ntrue_w = torch.tensor([2.0, -3.0, 0.5])\n# TODO: 用矩阵乘法算出每个样本的真实值，再加上截距 1 和少量噪声\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（matmul）：200×3 的矩阵乘以长度 3 的向量，用哪个运算符？\n\nprint(\"X:\", tuple(X.shape), \" y:\", tuple(y.shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：要学习的参数：告诉 PyTorch 记录梯度 [params] =====================\n# TODO: w 初始化为 3 个 0，b 初始化为 1 个 0，都需要梯度\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（reqgrad）：哪个参数让张量“需要梯度”？\n\nb = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：前向传播与均方误差 [loss] =====================\npred = X @ w + b\n# TODO: 预测值减真实值、平方、再取平均\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（mse）：先平方再平均，结果是一个数\n\nloss_before = loss.item()\nprint(\"初始损失：\", round(loss_before, 4))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：反向传播：梯度存到哪里了？ [backward] =====================\n# TODO: 从 loss 出发反向传播\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（backward2）：哪个方法从损失出发计算所有参数的梯度？\n\nprint(\"w 的梯度：\", w.grad)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：手写一步梯度下降，然后清空梯度 [step] =====================\nlr = 0.1\n# TODO: 在不记录梯度的上下文里，沿负梯度方向更新 w 和 b\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（nograd2）：修改参数本身的这一步不应该被 autograd 记录\n\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（update）：沿着梯度的反方向走一小步\n\n    b -= lr * b.grad\n# TODO: 把累加的梯度清零，为下一步做准备\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（zero）：带下划线的方法表示“原地修改”，哪个把张量置零？\n\nloss_after = ((X @ w + b - y) ** 2).mean().item()\nprint(f\"走了一步：损失 {loss_before:.4f} → {loss_after:.4f}\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：把这一步重复 100 次 [loop] =====================\nfor i in range(100):\n    pred = X @ w + b\n    loss = ((pred - y) ** 2).mean()\n    # TODO: 反向传播、更新、清零——和上一步完全一样\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（loop_bw）：每一轮先算出梯度\n\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        w -= lr * w.grad\n        b -= lr * b.grad\n    w.grad.zero_()\n    b.grad.zero_()\nprint(\"学到的 w：\", w.detach().numpy().round(3), \" b：\", round(b.item(), 3), \"（真实值 [2, -3, 0.5] 和 1）\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：换成 torch.optim.SGD：结果完全一样 [optim] =====================\nw2 = torch.zeros(3, requires_grad=True)\nb2 = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)\n# TODO: 让 SGD 负责更新 w2 和 b2，学习率与手写版相同\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（optlist）：优化器的第一个参数是“要更新的张量”组成的列表\n\nfor i in range(101):          # 手写版本一共更新了 1 + 100 步\n    loss2 = ((X @ w2 + b2 - y) ** 2).mean()\n    opt.zero_grad()\n    loss2.backward()\n    opt.step()\nprint(\"手写:\", w.detach().numpy().round(5), \" SGD:\", w2.detach().numpy().round(5))\n","l4":"\"\"\"\n拆开黑盒：手写反向传播之后的 step 与 zero_grad\n\n任务：不用优化器，手写梯度下降把 w、b 学出来；再用 torch.optim.SGD 重做一遍，两者结果完全一致。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：X, y, true_w, w, b, loss, loss_before, lr, w2, b2, opt\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：造一份已知答案的数据 [data] =====================\n# TODO: 用矩阵乘法算出每个样本的真实值，再加上截距 1 和少量噪声\n#   提示：200×3 的矩阵乘以长度 3 的向量，用哪个运算符？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：要学习的参数：告诉 PyTorch 记录梯度 [params] =====================\n# TODO: w 初始化为 3 个 0，b 初始化为 1 个 0，都需要梯度\n#   提示：哪个参数让张量“需要梯度”？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：前向传播与均方误差 [loss] =====================\n# TODO: 预测值减真实值、平方、再取平均\n#   提示：先平方再平均，结果是一个数\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：反向传播：梯度存到哪里了？ [backward] =====================\n# TODO: 从 loss 出发反向传播\n#   提示：哪个方法从损失出发计算所有参数的梯度？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：手写一步梯度下降，然后清空梯度 [step] =====================\n# TODO: 在不记录梯度的上下文里，沿负梯度方向更新 w 和 b\n#   提示：修改参数本身的这一步不应该被 autograd 记录\n#   提示：沿着梯度的反方向走一小步\n# TODO: 把累加的梯度清零，为下一步做准备\n#   提示：带下划线的方法表示“原地修改”，哪个把张量置零？\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：把这一步重复 100 次 [loop] =====================\n# TODO: 反向传播、更新、清零——和上一步完全一样\n#   提示：每一轮先算出梯度\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：换成 torch.optim.SGD：结果完全一样 [optim] =====================\n# TODO: 让 SGD 负责更新 w2 和 b2，学习率与手写版相同\n#   提示：优化器的第一个参数是“要更新的张量”组成的列表\n","answer":"\"\"\"\n拆开黑盒：手写反向传播之后的 step 与 zero_grad\n\n任务：不用优化器，手写梯度下降把 w、b 学出来；再用 torch.optim.SGD 重做一遍，两者结果完全一致。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：X, y, true_w, w, b, loss, loss_before, lr, w2, b2, opt\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：造一份已知答案的数据 [data] =====================\nimport torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nX = torch.randn(200, 3)\ntrue_w = torch.tensor([2.0, -3.0, 0.5])\n# 用矩阵乘法算出每个样本的真实值，再加上截距 1 和少量噪声\ny = X @ true_w + 1.0 + 0.1 * torch.randn(200)\nprint(\"X:\", tuple(X.shape), \" y:\", tuple(y.shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：要学习的参数：告诉 PyTorch 记录梯度 [params] =====================\n# w 初始化为 3 个 0，b 初始化为 1 个 0，都需要梯度\nw = torch.zeros(3, requires_grad=True)\nb = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：前向传播与均方误差 [loss] =====================\npred = X @ w + b\n# 预测值减真实值、平方、再取平均\nloss = ((pred - y) ** 2).mean()\nloss_before = loss.item()\nprint(\"初始损失：\", round(loss_before, 4))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：反向传播：梯度存到哪里了？ [backward] =====================\n# 从 loss 出发反向传播\nloss.backward()\nprint(\"w 的梯度：\", w.grad)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：手写一步梯度下降，然后清空梯度 [step] =====================\nlr = 0.1\n# 在不记录梯度的上下文里，沿负梯度方向更新 w 和 b\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    w -= lr * w.grad\n    b -= lr * b.grad\n# 把累加的梯度清零，为下一步做准备\nw.grad.zero_()\nb.grad.zero_()\nloss_after = ((X @ w + b - y) ** 2).mean().item()\nprint(f\"走了一步：损失 {loss_before:.4f} → {loss_after:.4f}\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：把这一步重复 100 次 [loop] =====================\nfor i in range(100):\n    pred = X @ w + b\n    loss = ((pred - y) ** 2).mean()\n    # 反向传播、更新、清零——和上一步完全一样\n    loss.backward()\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        w -= lr * w.grad\n        b -= lr * b.grad\n    w.grad.zero_()\n    b.grad.zero_()\nprint(\"学到的 w：\", w.detach().numpy().round(3), \" b：\", round(b.item(), 3), \"（真实值 [2, -3, 0.5] 和 1）\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：换成 torch.optim.SGD：结果完全一样 [optim] =====================\nw2 = torch.zeros(3, requires_grad=True)\nb2 = torch.zeros(1, requires_grad=True)\n# 让 SGD 负责更新 w2 和 b2，学习率与手写版相同\nopt = torch.optim.SGD([w2, b2], lr=lr)\nfor i in range(101):          # 手写版本一共更新了 1 + 100 步\n    loss2 = ((X @ w2 + b2 - y) ** 2).mean()\n    opt.zero_grad()\n    loss2.backward()\n    opt.step()\nprint(\"手写:\", w.detach().numpy().round(5), \" SGD:\", w2.detach().numpy().round(5))\n"},{"id":"ex05_cifar_cnn","file":"ex05_cifar_cnn.py","meta":{"title":"彩色图片分类：数据增强、BatchNorm、Dropout 与学习率调度","level":"进阶","dataset":"cifar10","chapter":"ch07","minutes":"40","goal":"在 CIFAR-10 上把训练做得更“像样”：只对训练集做数据增强、用 BatchNorm 稳定训练、用 Dropout 抑制过拟合、用学习率调度器逐步降低学习率，并弄清楚为什么评估前一定要 model.eval()。","task":"训练一个带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN，CIFAR-10 测试准确率达到 75% 以上（完整训练约 15 轮）。","names":"device, train_tf, test_tf, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, SmallCNN, model, criterion, optimizer, scheduler, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc","pass":"0.75"},"steps":[{"id":"setup","n":1,"title":"导入与设备","explain":"和前几篇一样的开头。CIFAR-10 是 10 类、32×32 的**彩色**图片（飞机、汽车、鸟、猫……），比 MNIST 难得多。","view":"import time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\nMEAN, STD = (0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)","answer":"import time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\nMEAN, STD = (0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)","checks":["assert isinstance(device, torch.device)"],"blanks":[]},{"id":"transforms","n":2,"title":"数据增强：只用在训练集","explain":"**数据增强**在每次取图时随机变一变（平移、翻转），相当于免费得到更多训练样本，是抑制过拟合最有效的手段之一。\n\n- `RandomCrop(32, padding=4)`：四周补 4 像素再随机裁回 32×32，相当于随机平移\n- `RandomHorizontalFlip()`：随机左右翻转。汽车、猫左右翻转后还是汽车、猫；但**上下翻转**会造出现实中不存在的图片\n\n**测试集绝不能做随机增强**：评估要的是稳定、可复现的结果。","view":"# 训练集：随机裁剪（补 4 像素）+ 随机左右翻转 + 转张量 + 标准化\ntrain_tf = transforms.Compose([\n    transforms.RandomCrop(32, ⟦crop_pad⟧),\n    transforms.⟦hflip⟧,\n    transforms.ToTensor(),\n    transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD),\n])\n# 测试集只转张量 + 标准化，不做任何随机变换\ntest_tf = transforms.Compose([⟦test_tf_b⟧])","answer":"# 训练集：随机裁剪（补 4 像素）+ 随机左右翻转 + 转张量 + 标准化\ntrain_tf = transforms.Compose([\n    transforms.RandomCrop(32, padding=4),\n    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(),\n    transforms.ToTensor(),\n    transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD),\n])\n# 测试集只转张量 + 标准化，不做任何随机变换\ntest_tf = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD)])","checks":["assert any(isinstance(t, transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip) for t in train_tf.transforms), \"训练集需要 RandomHorizontalFlip\"","assert any(isinstance(t, transforms.RandomCrop) for t in train_tf.transforms), \"训练集需要 RandomCrop\"","assert not any(\"Random\" in type(t).__name__ for t in test_tf.transforms), \"测试集不能有随机变换\"","assert any(isinstance(t, transforms.Normalize) for t in test_tf.transforms), \"测试集也要标准化（和训练集一致）\""],"blanks":[{"id":"crop_pad","mask":"padding=4","hint":"四周补几个像素再随机裁回 32×32？","options":["padding=4","padding=0","padding=32","size=4"],"accept":["padding = 4"],"why":"padding=0 时随机裁 32×32 等于原图，没有任何增强效果；补 4 像素允许最多 ±4 像素的平移。","lines":1},{"id":"hflip","mask":"RandomHorizontalFlip()","hint":"哪种翻转不会造出“不真实”的图片？","options":["RandomHorizontalFlip()","RandomVerticalFlip()","RandomRotation(180)","RandomInvert()"],"accept":[],"why":"左右镜像的汽车仍然是汽车；上下颠倒或旋转 180° 的图片在真实数据里几乎不会出现，反而会干扰学习。","lines":1},{"id":"test_tf_b","mask":"transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD)","hint":"测试集只保留确定性的变换","options":["transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD)","transforms.RandomCrop(32, padding=4), transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD)","transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(), transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD)","transforms.ToTensor()"],"accept":[],"why":"测试时做随机增强会让同一张图每次的预测不一样；同时别忘了标准化，训练和测试的预处理必须一致。","lines":1}]},{"id":"data","n":3,"title":"数据集：训练集和测试集用不同的 transform","explain":"训练集和测试集用**不同的** transform。CIFAR-10 已经在本地，`download=False`。","view":"train_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=train_tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=test_tf)","answer":"train_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=train_tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=test_tf)","checks":["assert len(train_set) == 50000 and len(test_set) == 10000, f\"CIFAR-10 训练集 50000、测试集 10000，实际 {len(train_set)} / {len(test_set)}\""],"blanks":[]},{"id":"loader","n":4,"title":"DataLoader","explain":"训练集打乱，测试集不打乱；测试时批可以大一些（不需要反向传播，占用显存少）。","view":"train_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)\nprint(\"训练样本：\", len(train_set), \"  测试样本：\", len(test_set))","answer":"train_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)\nprint(\"训练样本：\", len(train_set), \"  测试样本：\", len(test_set))","checks":["_x, _y = next(iter(train_loader)); assert tuple(_x.shape[1:]) == (3, 32, 32), f\"CIFAR 图片应是 (3, 32, 32)，实际 {tuple(_x.shape[1:])}\""],"blanks":[]},{"id":"model","n":5,"title":"带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN","explain":"每个卷积块：**卷积 → BatchNorm → ReLU**，两次后接最大池化。\n\n- **BatchNorm2d(C)**：把每个通道在一个批次里标准化，让每层的输入分布稳定，可以用更大的学习率、收敛更快。参数是通道数 C，要和前面卷积的输出通道一致\n- **Dropout(p)**：训练时随机把 p 比例的神经元置 0，逼网络不依赖个别特征，抑制过拟合\n- 卷积后面有 BatchNorm 时，卷积的偏置是多余的（BN 会减掉均值），所以 `bias=False`\n\n三个块后，32×32 变成 4×4，通道数 128，拉平长度 128×4×4 = 2048。","view":"def block(cin, cout):\n    return nn.Sequential(\n        nn.Conv2d(cin, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        nn.⟦bn⟧,\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.Conv2d(cout, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        nn.BatchNorm2d(cout),\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.MaxPool2d(2),\n    )\n\n\nclass SmallCNN(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 输入是 RGB 彩色图\n        self.features = nn.Sequential(⟦rgb⟧, block(32, 64), block(64, 128))\n        self.classifier = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Flatten(),\n            nn.⟦dropout⟧,\n            nn.Linear(128 * 4 * 4, 256),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\n            nn.Linear(256, num_classes),\n        )\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        return self.classifier(self.features(x))\n\n\nmodel = SmallCNN().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))","answer":"def block(cin, cout):\n    return nn.Sequential(\n        nn.Conv2d(cin, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        nn.BatchNorm2d(cout),\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.Conv2d(cout, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        nn.BatchNorm2d(cout),\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.MaxPool2d(2),\n    )\n\n\nclass SmallCNN(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 输入是 RGB 彩色图\n        self.features = nn.Sequential(block(3, 32), block(32, 64), block(64, 128))\n        self.classifier = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Flatten(),\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\n            nn.Linear(128 * 4 * 4, 256),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\n            nn.Linear(256, num_classes),\n        )\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        return self.classifier(self.features(x))\n\n\nmodel = SmallCNN().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))","checks":["_o = model(torch.zeros(2, 3, 32, 32, device=device)); assert tuple(_o.shape) == (2, 10), f\"模型输出应是 (2, 10)，实际 {tuple(_o.shape)}\"","assert any(isinstance(m, nn.BatchNorm2d) for m in model.modules()) and any(isinstance(m, nn.Dropout) for m in model.modules()), \"模型里需要 BatchNorm2d 和 Dropout\""],"blanks":[{"id":"bn","mask":"BatchNorm2d(cout)","hint":"对卷积输出的每个通道做批量归一化，参数是通道数","options":["BatchNorm2d(cout)","BatchNorm2d(cin)","BatchNorm1d(cout)","LayerNorm(cout)"],"accept":["BatchNorm2d(num_features=cout)"],"why":"BN 跟在卷积后面，要归一化的是卷积的输出，所以通道数是 cout；BatchNorm1d 用于全连接层的输出。","lines":1},{"id":"rgb","mask":"block(3, 32)","hint":"彩色图有几个通道？","options":["block(3, 32)","block(1, 32)","block(32, 3)","block(32, 32)"],"accept":[],"why":"CIFAR 是 RGB 三通道；MNIST 才是 1 通道。","lines":1},{"id":"dropout","mask":"Dropout(0.3)","hint":"训练时随机丢弃 30% 的神经元","options":["Dropout(0.3)","Dropout2d(3)","ReLU(0.3)","BatchNorm1d(0.3)"],"accept":["Dropout(p=0.3)"],"why":"nn.Dropout(p) 的 p 是丢弃概率（0~1）；它只在 model.train() 模式下生效，eval 模式下什么都不做。","lines":1}]},{"id":"optim","n":6,"title":"优化器、权重衰减与学习率调度","explain":"- `weight_decay`：权重衰减（L2 正则），每步把权重往 0 拉一点，进一步防止过拟合，常用 5e-4\n- **学习率调度器**：前期用大学习率快速下降，后期用小学习率精细调整。`CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=EPOCHS)` 让学习率在 EPOCHS 轮里按余弦曲线从初始值降到 0\n- 调度器要在**每轮结束时**调用一次 `scheduler.step()`","view":"criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\nEPOCHS = 15\n# Adam，学习率 1e-3，权重衰减 5e-4\noptimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3, ⟦wd⟧)\n# 余弦退火：在 EPOCHS 轮内把学习率降到 0\nscheduler = torch.optim.lr_scheduler.⟦cosine⟧(optimizer, T_max=EPOCHS)","answer":"criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\nEPOCHS = 15\n# Adam，学习率 1e-3，权重衰减 5e-4\noptimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3, weight_decay=5e-4)\n# 余弦退火：在 EPOCHS 轮内把学习率降到 0\nscheduler = torch.optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=EPOCHS)","checks":["assert optimizer.param_groups[0][\"weight_decay\"] > 0, \"优化器需要设置 weight_decay\"","assert isinstance(scheduler, torch.optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR), \"这里要用 CosineAnnealingLR\""],"blanks":[{"id":"wd","mask":"weight_decay=5e-4","hint":"L2 正则在优化器里叫什么参数？","options":["weight_decay=5e-4","momentum=5e-4","dropout=5e-4","lr_decay=5e-4"],"accept":["weight_decay=0.0005","weight_decay = 5e-4"],"why":"weight_decay 在每次更新时额外减去 wd × 参数，等价于在损失里加 L2 正则项。","lines":1},{"id":"cosine","mask":"CosineAnnealingLR","hint":"学习率按余弦曲线下降的调度器","options":["CosineAnnealingLR","StepLR","ExponentialLR","ReduceLROnPlateau"],"accept":[],"why":"CosineAnnealingLR 平滑地降到 0；StepLR 每隔固定轮数乘一个系数（阶梯形）。","lines":1}]},{"id":"evaluate","n":7,"title":"为什么评估前一定要 model.eval()","explain":"BatchNorm 和 Dropout 在训练和评估时**行为不同**：\n\n- Dropout：训练时随机丢弃；评估时全部保留\n- BatchNorm：训练时用当前批次的均值方差；评估时用训练中累计的全局均值方差\n\n忘了 `model.eval()`，同一张图两次预测结果会不一样，准确率也会偏低。评测会把同一批数据预测两次，检查结果是否完全一致。","view":"@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    ⟦eval3⟧\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total","answer":"@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    model.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total","checks":["_xb = next(iter(test_loader))[0][:64].to(device); evaluate([(_xb, torch.zeros(len(_xb), dtype=torch.long, device=device))]); assert torch.equal(model(_xb), model(_xb)), \"评估模式下同一批图片两次预测应完全一致：evaluate() 里要调用 model.eval()\""],"blanks":[{"id":"eval3","mask":"model.eval()","hint":"让 Dropout 关闭、BatchNorm 使用全局统计量","options":["model.eval()","model.train()","torch.no_grad()","model.requires_grad_(False)"],"accept":[],"why":"no_grad 只是不算梯度，并不会切换 Dropout/BatchNorm 的行为；只有 model.eval() 会。","lines":1}]},{"id":"train","n":8,"title":"训练循环 + 每轮更新学习率","explain":"五个固定动作之外，多了一件事：每轮结束调用 `scheduler.step()` 更新学习率。可以在日志里看到学习率逐轮下降。\n\n想看完整效果，在页面上点“放进实验室”完整训练 15 轮（Apple M3 约 2–3 分钟，RTX 3060 更快）。","view":"for epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    # 每轮结束更新一次学习率\n    ⟦sched_step⟧\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    lr_now = optimizer.param_groups[0][\"lr\"]\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  学习率 {lr_now:.6f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, lr=lr_now, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)","answer":"for epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    # 每轮结束更新一次学习率\n    scheduler.step()\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    lr_now = optimizer.param_groups[0][\"lr\"]\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  学习率 {lr_now:.6f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, lr=lr_now, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)","checks":["assert optimizer.param_groups[0][\"lr\"] < 1e-3, \"训练结束时学习率应该已经下降：每轮末尾要调用 scheduler.step()\"","assert test_acc > 0.3, f\"测试准确率只有 {test_acc:.2%}（随机猜是 10%），检查模型和训练循环\""],"blanks":[{"id":"sched_step","mask":"scheduler.step()","hint":"调度器在每轮结束时要做什么？","options":["scheduler.step()","optimizer.step()","scheduler.zero_grad()","scheduler.update()"],"accept":[],"why":"scheduler.step() 按调度规则修改 optimizer 里的 lr；它通常每轮调一次（OneCycleLR 这类是每个 batch 调一次）。","lines":1}]}],"l3":"\"\"\"\n彩色图片分类：数据增强、BatchNorm、Dropout 与学习率调度\n\n任务：训练一个带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN，CIFAR-10 测试准确率达到 75% 以上（完整训练约 15 轮）。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_tf, test_tf, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, SmallCNN, model, criterion, optimizer, scheduler, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入与设备 [setup] =====================\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\nMEAN, STD = (0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：数据增强：只用在训练集 [transforms] =====================\n# TODO: 训练集：随机裁剪（补 4 像素）+ 随机左右翻转 + 转张量 + 标准化\ntrain_tf = transforms.Compose([\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（crop_pad）：四周补几个像素再随机裁回 32×32？\n\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（hflip）：哪种翻转不会造出“不真实”的图片？\n\n    transforms.ToTensor(),\n    transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD),\n])\n# TODO: 测试集只转张量 + 标准化，不做任何随机变换\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（test_tf_b）：测试集只保留确定性的变换\n\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：数据集：训练集和测试集用不同的 transform [data] =====================\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=train_tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=test_tf)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：DataLoader [loader] =====================\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)\nprint(\"训练样本：\", len(train_set), \"  测试样本：\", len(test_set))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN [model] =====================\ndef block(cin, cout):\n    return nn.Sequential(\n        nn.Conv2d(cin, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（bn）：对卷积输出的每个通道做批量归一化，参数是通道数\n\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.Conv2d(cout, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        nn.BatchNorm2d(cout),\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.MaxPool2d(2),\n    )\n\n\nclass SmallCNN(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        # TODO: 输入是 RGB 彩色图\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（rgb）：彩色图有几个通道？\n\n        self.classifier = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Flatten(),\n            # ✏️ 在这里写代码（dropout）：训练时随机丢弃 30% 的神经元\n\n            nn.Linear(128 * 4 * 4, 256),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\n            nn.Linear(256, num_classes),\n        )\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        return self.classifier(self.features(x))\n\n\nmodel = SmallCNN().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：优化器、权重衰减与学习率调度 [optim] =====================\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\nEPOCHS = 15\n# TODO: Adam，学习率 1e-3，权重衰减 5e-4\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（wd）：L2 正则在优化器里叫什么参数？\n\n# TODO: 余弦退火：在 EPOCHS 轮内把学习率降到 0\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（cosine）：学习率按余弦曲线下降的调度器\n\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：为什么评估前一定要 model.eval() [evaluate] =====================\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（eval3）：让 Dropout 关闭、BatchNorm 使用全局统计量\n    pass\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：训练循环 + 每轮更新学习率 [train] =====================\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    # TODO: 每轮结束更新一次学习率\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（sched_step）：调度器在每轮结束时要做什么？\n\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    lr_now = optimizer.param_groups[0][\"lr\"]\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  学习率 {lr_now:.6f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, lr=lr_now, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)\n","l4":"\"\"\"\n彩色图片分类：数据增强、BatchNorm、Dropout 与学习率调度\n\n任务：训练一个带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN，CIFAR-10 测试准确率达到 75% 以上（完整训练约 15 轮）。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_tf, test_tf, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, SmallCNN, model, criterion, optimizer, scheduler, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入与设备 [setup] =====================\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：数据增强：只用在训练集 [transforms] =====================\n# TODO: 训练集：随机裁剪（补 4 像素）+ 随机左右翻转 + 转张量 + 标准化\n#   提示：四周补几个像素再随机裁回 32×32？\n#   提示：哪种翻转不会造出“不真实”的图片？\n# TODO: 测试集只转张量 + 标准化，不做任何随机变换\n#   提示：测试集只保留确定性的变换\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：数据集：训练集和测试集用不同的 transform [data] =====================\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：DataLoader [loader] =====================\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN [model] =====================\n#   提示：对卷积输出的每个通道做批量归一化，参数是通道数\n# TODO: 输入是 RGB 彩色图\n#   提示：彩色图有几个通道？\n#   提示：训练时随机丢弃 30% 的神经元\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：优化器、权重衰减与学习率调度 [optim] =====================\n# TODO: Adam，学习率 1e-3，权重衰减 5e-4\n#   提示：L2 正则在优化器里叫什么参数？\n# TODO: 余弦退火：在 EPOCHS 轮内把学习率降到 0\n#   提示：学习率按余弦曲线下降的调度器\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：为什么评估前一定要 model.eval() [evaluate] =====================\n#   提示：让 Dropout 关闭、BatchNorm 使用全局统计量\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：训练循环 + 每轮更新学习率 [train] =====================\n# TODO: 每轮结束更新一次学习率\n#   提示：调度器在每轮结束时要做什么？\n","answer":"\"\"\"\n彩色图片分类：数据增强、BatchNorm、Dropout 与学习率调度\n\n任务：训练一个带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN，CIFAR-10 测试准确率达到 75% 以上（完整训练约 15 轮）。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, train_tf, test_tf, train_set, test_set, train_loader, test_loader, SmallCNN, model, criterion, optimizer, scheduler, EPOCHS, evaluate, test_acc\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入与设备 [setup] =====================\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\nMEAN, STD = (0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：数据增强：只用在训练集 [transforms] =====================\n# 训练集：随机裁剪（补 4 像素）+ 随机左右翻转 + 转张量 + 标准化\ntrain_tf = transforms.Compose([\n    transforms.RandomCrop(32, padding=4),\n    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(),\n    transforms.ToTensor(),\n    transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD),\n])\n# 测试集只转张量 + 标准化，不做任何随机变换\ntest_tf = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize(MEAN, STD)])\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：数据集：训练集和测试集用不同的 transform [data] =====================\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=train_tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=test_tf)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：DataLoader [loader] =====================\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)\nprint(\"训练样本：\", len(train_set), \"  测试样本：\", len(test_set))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：带 BatchNorm 和 Dropout 的 CNN [model] =====================\ndef block(cin, cout):\n    return nn.Sequential(\n        nn.Conv2d(cin, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        nn.BatchNorm2d(cout),\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.Conv2d(cout, cout, 3, padding=1, bias=False),\n        nn.BatchNorm2d(cout),\n        nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n        nn.MaxPool2d(2),\n    )\n\n\nclass SmallCNN(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 输入是 RGB 彩色图\n        self.features = nn.Sequential(block(3, 32), block(32, 64), block(64, 128))\n        self.classifier = nn.Sequential(\n            nn.Flatten(),\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\n            nn.Linear(128 * 4 * 4, 256),\n            nn.ReLU(inplace=True),\n            nn.Dropout(0.3),\n            nn.Linear(256, num_classes),\n        )\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        return self.classifier(self.features(x))\n\n\nmodel = SmallCNN().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：优化器、权重衰减与学习率调度 [optim] =====================\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\nEPOCHS = 15\n# Adam，学习率 1e-3，权重衰减 5e-4\noptimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3, weight_decay=5e-4)\n# 余弦退火：在 EPOCHS 轮内把学习率降到 0\nscheduler = torch.optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=EPOCHS)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：为什么评估前一定要 model.eval() [evaluate] =====================\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(loader):\n    model.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (model(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：训练循环 + 每轮更新学习率 [train] =====================\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    model.train()\n    t0, seen, loss_sum, correct = time.time(), 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    # 每轮结束更新一次学习率\n    scheduler.step()\n    epoch_time = time.time() - t0\n    test_acc = evaluate(test_loader)\n    lr_now = optimizer.param_groups[0][\"lr\"]\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {correct / seen:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  学习率 {lr_now:.6f}  用时 {epoch_time:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=loss_sum / seen, train_acc=correct / seen, test_acc=test_acc, lr=lr_now, epoch_time=epoch_time, img_per_s=seen / epoch_time)\n"},{"id":"ex06_resnet_checkpoint","file":"ex06_resnet_checkpoint.py","meta":{"title":"残差网络与断点续训：ResNet 积木块、保存与恢复训练","level":"进阶","dataset":"cifar10","chapter":"ch08","minutes":"40","goal":"亲手写出 ResNet 的核心——残差块（输出 = F(x) + x），搭成一个小 ResNet；再学会保存“检查点”（模型 + 优化器 + 轮数），程序中断后能从断点接着训练。","task":"搭一个小 ResNet 在 CIFAR-10 上训练，保存检查点，再从检查点恢复出一个预测完全相同的模型。","names":"device, BasicBlock, SmallResNet, model, train_loader, test_loader, criterion, optimizer, train_one_epoch, evaluate, ckpt, model2","pass":"0.80"},"steps":[{"id":"setup","n":1,"title":"导入、设备与数据","explain":"数据部分沿用第 5 篇（为了评测更快，这里只用确定性的预处理）。","view":"import time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntf = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616))])\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=tf)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)","answer":"import time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntf = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616))])\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=tf)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)","checks":["assert len(train_set) == 50000, f\"CIFAR-10 训练集应有 50000 张，实际 {len(train_set)}\""],"blanks":[]},{"id":"loader","n":2,"title":"DataLoader","explain":"和前几篇一样：训练集打乱，测试集不打乱。","view":"train_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)","answer":"train_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)","checks":["assert len(train_loader) > 0 and len(test_loader) > 0"],"blanks":[]},{"id":"block","n":3,"title":"残差块：输出 = F(x) + x","explain":"网络很深时，梯度一层层往回传会越来越小，深层网络反而训练不好。ResNet 的办法是给每两层加一条**捷径（shortcut）**：\n\n$$\\text{输出} = \\text{ReLU}\\big(F(x) + x\\big)$$\n\nF(x) 只需要学“在 x 基础上要改多少”（残差）。梯度可以沿着 “+x” 这条路直接回传。\n\n当这个块要**改变形状**（步长 2 缩小尺寸，或通道数变化）时，x 和 F(x) 形状对不上，捷径上要放一个 1×1 卷积把 x 变成相同形状。","view":"class BasicBlock(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch, stride=1):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 3, stride, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn1 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(out_ch, out_ch, 3, 1, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn2 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        # 形状会变（步长不为 1，或输入输出通道不同）时，捷径用 1×1 卷积 + BN；否则直接恒等映射\n        if ⟦need_proj⟧:\n            self.shortcut = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 1, stride, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch))\n        else:\n            self.shortcut = nn.Identity()\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        out = F.relu(self.bn1(self.conv1(x)))\n        out = self.bn2(self.conv2(out))\n        # 残差连接：把捷径的输出加回来，再过 ReLU\n        return F.relu(⟦residual⟧)\n\n\n_b1 = BasicBlock(16, 16)\n_b2 = BasicBlock(16, 32, stride=2)\nprint(\"同形状块：\", tuple(_b1(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape), \" 下采样块：\", tuple(_b2(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape))","answer":"class BasicBlock(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch, stride=1):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 3, stride, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn1 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(out_ch, out_ch, 3, 1, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn2 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        # 形状会变（步长不为 1，或输入输出通道不同）时，捷径用 1×1 卷积 + BN；否则直接恒等映射\n        if stride != 1 or in_ch != out_ch:\n            self.shortcut = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 1, stride, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch))\n        else:\n            self.shortcut = nn.Identity()\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        out = F.relu(self.bn1(self.conv1(x)))\n        out = self.bn2(self.conv2(out))\n        # 残差连接：把捷径的输出加回来，再过 ReLU\n        return F.relu(out + self.shortcut(x))\n\n\n_b1 = BasicBlock(16, 16)\n_b2 = BasicBlock(16, 32, stride=2)\nprint(\"同形状块：\", tuple(_b1(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape), \" 下采样块：\", tuple(_b2(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape))","checks":["assert tuple(BasicBlock(16, 32, stride=2)(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape) == (2, 32, 16, 16), \"BasicBlock(16, 32, stride=2) 应输出 (2, 32, 16, 16)\"","assert tuple(BasicBlock(16, 32)(torch.randn(2, 16, 8, 8)).shape) == (2, 32, 8, 8), \"只改变通道数时，捷径也需要 1×1 卷积\"","assert tuple(BasicBlock(32, 32, stride=2)(torch.randn(2, 32, 16, 16)).shape) == (2, 32, 8, 8), \"通道数不变、只有步长为 2 时，捷径也需要 1×1 卷积（条件要同时判断 stride 和通道数）\"","assert isinstance(BasicBlock(16, 16).shortcut, nn.Identity), \"形状不变时捷径应是 nn.Identity()\"","_bb = BasicBlock(8, 8).eval(); torch.nn.init.zeros_(_bb.bn2.weight); _xx = torch.rand(1, 8, 4, 4); assert torch.allclose(_bb(_xx), F.relu(_xx)), \"残差块的输出应是 relu(F(x) + x)：当 F(x)=0 时输出应等于 relu(x)\""],"blanks":[{"id":"need_proj","mask":"stride != 1 or in_ch != out_ch","hint":"什么时候 x 和 F(x) 的形状会不一样？","options":["stride != 1 or in_ch != out_ch","stride == 1 and in_ch == out_ch","in_ch != out_ch","stride != 1"],"accept":["in_ch != out_ch or stride != 1"],"why":"两种情况都会让形状变化：步长 2 让高宽减半，通道数变化让 C 不同。只判断其中一个，另一种情况下相加会报形状错误。","lines":1},{"id":"residual","mask":"out + self.shortcut(x)","hint":"ResNet 的灵魂就是这一个加号","options":["out + self.shortcut(x)","out * self.shortcut(x)","torch.cat([out, self.shortcut(x)], 1)","self.shortcut(out)"],"accept":["self.shortcut(x) + out"],"why":"逐元素相加是 ResNet；沿通道拼接 torch.cat 是 DenseNet 的做法；相乘会破坏“恒等映射”的性质。","lines":1}]},{"id":"net","n":4,"title":"搭一个小 ResNet","explain":"结构：3×3 卷积 stem → 3 个阶段（每个阶段 2 个残差块，通道 32 → 64 → 128，后两个阶段第一个块步长 2）→ **全局平均池化** → 全连接。\n\n全局平均池化 `AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)` 把每个通道的整张特征图平均成 1 个数，不管输入多大都输出 (N, C, 1, 1)，所以不用手算拉平长度。","view":"class SmallResNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.stem = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(3, 32, 3, 1, 1, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(32), nn.ReLU(inplace=True))\n        self.layers = nn.Sequential(\n            BasicBlock(32, 32), BasicBlock(32, 32),\n            BasicBlock(32, 64, stride=2), BasicBlock(64, 64),\n            BasicBlock(64, 128, stride=2), BasicBlock(128, 128),\n        )\n        # 全局平均池化：每个通道变成 1×1\n        self.pool = nn.⟦gap⟧\n        self.fc = nn.Linear(128, num_classes)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        x = self.layers(self.stem(x))\n        return self.fc(torch.flatten(self.pool(x), 1))\n\n\nmodel = SmallResNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))","answer":"class SmallResNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.stem = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(3, 32, 3, 1, 1, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(32), nn.ReLU(inplace=True))\n        self.layers = nn.Sequential(\n            BasicBlock(32, 32), BasicBlock(32, 32),\n            BasicBlock(32, 64, stride=2), BasicBlock(64, 64),\n            BasicBlock(64, 128, stride=2), BasicBlock(128, 128),\n        )\n        # 全局平均池化：每个通道变成 1×1\n        self.pool = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)\n        self.fc = nn.Linear(128, num_classes)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        x = self.layers(self.stem(x))\n        return self.fc(torch.flatten(self.pool(x), 1))\n\n\nmodel = SmallResNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))","checks":["_o = model(torch.zeros(2, 3, 32, 32, device=device)); assert tuple(_o.shape) == (2, 10), f\"模型输出应是 (2, 10)，实际 {tuple(_o.shape)}\"","_o2 = model(torch.zeros(2, 3, 64, 64, device=device)); assert tuple(_o2.shape) == (2, 10), \"用了全局平均池化后，64×64 的输入也应输出 (2, 10)\""],"blanks":[{"id":"gap","mask":"AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)","hint":"不管输入多大，都输出 1×1 的池化层","options":["AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)","MaxPool2d(1)","AvgPool2d(2)","Flatten(1)"],"accept":["AdaptiveAvgPool2d((1, 1))"],"why":"AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1) 自动选窗口大小，输出固定为 1×1；AvgPool2d(2) 只是把尺寸减半。","lines":1}]},{"id":"optim","n":5,"title":"损失、优化器与轮数","explain":"带动量的 SGD 是训练 ResNet 的经典选择（论文里用的就是它），学习率 0.05、动量 0.9、权重衰减 5e-4。","view":"criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nEPOCHS = 10","answer":"criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nEPOCHS = 10","checks":["assert optimizer.param_groups[0][\"momentum\"] == 0.9"],"blanks":[]},{"id":"train","n":6,"title":"把一轮训练写成函数","explain":"把“训练一轮”写成函数 `train_one_epoch()`，后面恢复训练时可以直接再调用。五个固定动作，这次全部自己写。","view":"\n\ndef train_one_epoch():\n    model.train()\n    seen, loss_sum, correct = 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        # 前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向 → 更新\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = ⟦five⟧\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    return loss_sum / seen, correct / seen\n\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(m):\n    m.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in test_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (m(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    t0 = time.time()\n    train_loss, train_acc = train_one_epoch()\n    test_acc = evaluate(model)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {train_acc:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {time.time() - t0:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=train_loss, train_acc=train_acc, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=time.time() - t0)","answer":"\n\ndef train_one_epoch():\n    model.train()\n    seen, loss_sum, correct = 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        # 前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向 → 更新\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    return loss_sum / seen, correct / seen\n\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(m):\n    m.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in test_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (m(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    t0 = time.time()\n    train_loss, train_acc = train_one_epoch()\n    test_acc = evaluate(model)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {train_acc:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {time.time() - t0:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=train_loss, train_acc=train_acc, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=time.time() - t0)","checks":["assert test_acc > 0.3, f\"训练后测试准确率只有 {test_acc:.2%}（随机猜是 10%），检查 train_one_epoch 里的五个动作\""],"blanks":[{"id":"five","mask":"criterion(logits, yb)","hint":"先算出 logits，再用损失函数和标签比较","options":["criterion(logits, yb)","criterion(yb, logits)","criterion(logits)","criterion(model, yb)"],"accept":[],"why":"这五行是所有 PyTorch 训练代码的骨架；漏掉 backward 时 step 拿不到梯度，参数不会变化。","lines":5}]},{"id":"save","n":7,"title":"保存检查点：不只是模型","explain":"只保存 `model.state_dict()` 够用来**预测**，但不够用来**继续训练**：\n\n- 优化器也有状态（SGD 的动量、Adam 的一阶二阶矩），丢了它，恢复后的前几步会走歪\n- 还要记下训练到了第几轮\n\n所以检查点是一个字典：`{\"epoch\", \"model\", \"optimizer\"}`。","view":"# 保存轮数、模型参数和优化器状态\nckpt = {\n    \"epoch\": EPOCHS,\n    \"model\": model.state_dict(),\n    \"optimizer\": ⟦opt_state⟧,\n}\ntorch.save(ckpt, \"resnet_ckpt.pt\")\nprint(\"检查点已保存：resnet_ckpt.pt\")","answer":"# 保存轮数、模型参数和优化器状态\nckpt = {\n    \"epoch\": EPOCHS,\n    \"model\": model.state_dict(),\n    \"optimizer\": optimizer.state_dict(),\n}\ntorch.save(ckpt, \"resnet_ckpt.pt\")\nprint(\"检查点已保存：resnet_ckpt.pt\")","checks":["import os as _o; assert _o.path.exists(\"resnet_ckpt.pt\"), \"没有找到 resnet_ckpt.pt\"","_c = torch.load(\"resnet_ckpt.pt\"); assert {\"epoch\", \"model\", \"optimizer\"} <= set(_c), \"检查点里应包含 epoch、model、optimizer 三项\"","assert len(_c[\"optimizer\"][\"state\"]) > 0, \"optimizer 的状态是空的：应该保存 optimizer.state_dict()\""],"blanks":[{"id":"opt_state","mask":"optimizer.state_dict()","hint":"动量等优化器内部状态也要保存","options":["optimizer.state_dict()","optimizer.param_groups","optimizer","model.parameters()"],"accept":[],"why":"optimizer.state_dict() 包含动量缓存和超参数；直接保存 optimizer 对象会依赖代码结构，不推荐。","lines":1}]},{"id":"resume","n":8,"title":"从检查点恢复","explain":"恢复的顺序：先按同样的结构**新建**模型和优化器，再把保存的状态**加载**进去。加载后的模型应该和原来的模型预测完全一致。\n\n跨设备加载（例如在 RTX 3060 上训练、拿到 Mac 上用）时，加 `map_location=device` 把张量放到当前设备上。","view":"model2 = SmallResNet().to(device)\noptimizer2 = torch.optim.SGD(model2.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nsaved = torch.load(\"resnet_ckpt.pt\", map_location=device)\n# 把保存的参数加载进新模型，再恢复优化器状态\nmodel2.⟦load_sd⟧(saved[\"model\"])\noptimizer2.load_state_dict(saved[\"optimizer\"])\nstart_epoch = saved[\"epoch\"] + 1\nprint(\"从第\", start_epoch, \"轮继续训练；恢复后的测试准确率：\", evaluate(model2))","answer":"model2 = SmallResNet().to(device)\noptimizer2 = torch.optim.SGD(model2.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nsaved = torch.load(\"resnet_ckpt.pt\", map_location=device)\n# 把保存的参数加载进新模型，再恢复优化器状态\nmodel2.load_state_dict(saved[\"model\"])\noptimizer2.load_state_dict(saved[\"optimizer\"])\nstart_epoch = saved[\"epoch\"] + 1\nprint(\"从第\", start_epoch, \"轮继续训练；恢复后的测试准确率：\", evaluate(model2))","checks":["model.eval(); model2.eval(); _x = next(iter(test_loader))[0][:16].to(device); assert torch.allclose(model(_x), model2(_x), atol=1e-5), \"恢复出来的模型预测应与原模型完全一致：检查 load_state_dict\""],"blanks":[{"id":"load_sd","mask":"load_state_dict","hint":"和 state_dict() 对应的加载方法","options":["load_state_dict","state_dict","load","from_state_dict"],"accept":[],"why":"model.load_state_dict(字典) 把参数逐个拷进新模型；参数名和形状必须完全对应，所以要先建同样结构的模型。","lines":1}]}],"l3":"\"\"\"\n残差网络与断点续训：ResNet 积木块、保存与恢复训练\n\n任务：搭一个小 ResNet 在 CIFAR-10 上训练，保存检查点，再从检查点恢复出一个预测完全相同的模型。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, BasicBlock, SmallResNet, model, train_loader, test_loader, criterion, optimizer, train_one_epoch, evaluate, ckpt, model2\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入、设备与数据 [setup] =====================\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntf = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616))])\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=tf)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：DataLoader [loader] =====================\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：残差块：输出 = F(x) + x [block] =====================\nclass BasicBlock(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch, stride=1):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 3, stride, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn1 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(out_ch, out_ch, 3, 1, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn2 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        # TODO: 形状会变（步长不为 1，或输入输出通道不同）时，捷径用 1×1 卷积 + BN；否则直接恒等映射\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（need_proj）：什么时候 x 和 F(x) 的形状会不一样？\n\n            self.shortcut = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 1, stride, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch))\n        else:\n            self.shortcut = nn.Identity()\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        out = F.relu(self.bn1(self.conv1(x)))\n        out = self.bn2(self.conv2(out))\n        # TODO: 残差连接：把捷径的输出加回来，再过 ReLU\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（residual）：ResNet 的灵魂就是这一个加号\n\n\n\n_b1 = BasicBlock(16, 16)\n_b2 = BasicBlock(16, 32, stride=2)\nprint(\"同形状块：\", tuple(_b1(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape), \" 下采样块：\", tuple(_b2(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：搭一个小 ResNet [net] =====================\nclass SmallResNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.stem = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(3, 32, 3, 1, 1, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(32), nn.ReLU(inplace=True))\n        self.layers = nn.Sequential(\n            BasicBlock(32, 32), BasicBlock(32, 32),\n            BasicBlock(32, 64, stride=2), BasicBlock(64, 64),\n            BasicBlock(64, 128, stride=2), BasicBlock(128, 128),\n        )\n        # TODO: 全局平均池化：每个通道变成 1×1\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（gap）：不管输入多大，都输出 1×1 的池化层\n\n        self.fc = nn.Linear(128, num_classes)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        x = self.layers(self.stem(x))\n        return self.fc(torch.flatten(self.pool(x), 1))\n\n\nmodel = SmallResNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：损失、优化器与轮数 [optim] =====================\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nEPOCHS = 10\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：把一轮训练写成函数 [train] =====================\n\n\ndef train_one_epoch():\n    model.train()\n    seen, loss_sum, correct = 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        # TODO: 前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向 → 更新\n        # ✏️ 在这里写代码（five）：先算出 logits，再用损失函数和标签比较\n\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    return loss_sum / seen, correct / seen\n\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(m):\n    m.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in test_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (m(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    t0 = time.time()\n    train_loss, train_acc = train_one_epoch()\n    test_acc = evaluate(model)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {train_acc:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {time.time() - t0:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=train_loss, train_acc=train_acc, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=time.time() - t0)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：保存检查点：不只是模型 [save] =====================\n# TODO: 保存轮数、模型参数和优化器状态\nckpt = {\n    \"epoch\": EPOCHS,\n    \"model\": model.state_dict(),\n    # ✏️ 在这里写代码（opt_state）：动量等优化器内部状态也要保存\n\n}\ntorch.save(ckpt, \"resnet_ckpt.pt\")\nprint(\"检查点已保存：resnet_ckpt.pt\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：从检查点恢复 [resume] =====================\nmodel2 = SmallResNet().to(device)\noptimizer2 = torch.optim.SGD(model2.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nsaved = torch.load(\"resnet_ckpt.pt\", map_location=device)\n# TODO: 把保存的参数加载进新模型，再恢复优化器状态\n# ✏️ 在这里写代码（load_sd）：和 state_dict() 对应的加载方法\n\noptimizer2.load_state_dict(saved[\"optimizer\"])\nstart_epoch = saved[\"epoch\"] + 1\nprint(\"从第\", start_epoch, \"轮继续训练；恢复后的测试准确率：\", evaluate(model2))\n","l4":"\"\"\"\n残差网络与断点续训：ResNet 积木块、保存与恢复训练\n\n任务：搭一个小 ResNet 在 CIFAR-10 上训练，保存检查点，再从检查点恢复出一个预测完全相同的模型。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, BasicBlock, SmallResNet, model, train_loader, test_loader, criterion, optimizer, train_one_epoch, evaluate, ckpt, model2\n每个“步骤”标题行不要删除：评测按步骤运行检查，并告诉你哪一步出了问题。\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入、设备与数据 [setup] =====================\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：DataLoader [loader] =====================\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：残差块：输出 = F(x) + x [block] =====================\n# TODO: 形状会变（步长不为 1，或输入输出通道不同）时，捷径用 1×1 卷积 + BN；否则直接恒等映射\n#   提示：什么时候 x 和 F(x) 的形状会不一样？\n# TODO: 残差连接：把捷径的输出加回来，再过 ReLU\n#   提示：ResNet 的灵魂就是这一个加号\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：搭一个小 ResNet [net] =====================\n# TODO: 全局平均池化：每个通道变成 1×1\n#   提示：不管输入多大，都输出 1×1 的池化层\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：损失、优化器与轮数 [optim] =====================\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：把一轮训练写成函数 [train] =====================\n# TODO: 前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向 → 更新\n#   提示：先算出 logits，再用损失函数和标签比较\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：保存检查点：不只是模型 [save] =====================\n# TODO: 保存轮数、模型参数和优化器状态\n#   提示：动量等优化器内部状态也要保存\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：从检查点恢复 [resume] =====================\n# TODO: 把保存的参数加载进新模型，再恢复优化器状态\n#   提示：和 state_dict() 对应的加载方法\n","answer":"\"\"\"\n残差网络与断点续训：ResNet 积木块、保存与恢复训练\n\n任务：搭一个小 ResNet 在 CIFAR-10 上训练，保存检查点，再从检查点恢复出一个预测完全相同的模型。\n请使用这些变量名（评测会检查）：device, BasicBlock, SmallResNet, model, train_loader, test_loader, criterion, optimizer, train_one_epoch, evaluate, ckpt, model2\n\"\"\"\n\n# ===================== 步骤 1：导入、设备与数据 [setup] =====================\nimport time\n\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport torchvision\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom torchvision import transforms\n\nfrom labkit import DATA_ROOT, log_epoch\n\ndevice = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"mps\" if torch.backends.mps.is_available() else \"cpu\")\ntf = transforms.Compose([transforms.ToTensor(), transforms.Normalize((0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465), (0.2470, 0.2435, 0.2616))])\ntrain_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=True, download=False, transform=tf)\ntest_set = torchvision.datasets.CIFAR10(DATA_ROOT, train=False, download=False, transform=tf)\nprint(\"设备：\", device)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 2：DataLoader [loader] =====================\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(train_set, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)\ntest_loader = DataLoader(test_set, batch_size=500)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 3：残差块：输出 = F(x) + x [block] =====================\nclass BasicBlock(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch, stride=1):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 3, stride, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn1 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(out_ch, out_ch, 3, 1, 1, bias=False)\n        self.bn2 = nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch)\n        # 形状会变（步长不为 1，或输入输出通道不同）时，捷径用 1×1 卷积 + BN；否则直接恒等映射\n        if stride != 1 or in_ch != out_ch:\n            self.shortcut = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(in_ch, out_ch, 1, stride, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch))\n        else:\n            self.shortcut = nn.Identity()\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        out = F.relu(self.bn1(self.conv1(x)))\n        out = self.bn2(self.conv2(out))\n        # 残差连接：把捷径的输出加回来，再过 ReLU\n        return F.relu(out + self.shortcut(x))\n\n\n_b1 = BasicBlock(16, 16)\n_b2 = BasicBlock(16, 32, stride=2)\nprint(\"同形状块：\", tuple(_b1(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape), \" 下采样块：\", tuple(_b2(torch.randn(2, 16, 32, 32)).shape))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 4：搭一个小 ResNet [net] =====================\nclass SmallResNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, num_classes=10):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.stem = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(3, 32, 3, 1, 1, bias=False), nn.BatchNorm2d(32), nn.ReLU(inplace=True))\n        self.layers = nn.Sequential(\n            BasicBlock(32, 32), BasicBlock(32, 32),\n            BasicBlock(32, 64, stride=2), BasicBlock(64, 64),\n            BasicBlock(64, 128, stride=2), BasicBlock(128, 128),\n        )\n        # 全局平均池化：每个通道变成 1×1\n        self.pool = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)\n        self.fc = nn.Linear(128, num_classes)\n\n    def forward(self, x):\n        x = self.layers(self.stem(x))\n        return self.fc(torch.flatten(self.pool(x), 1))\n\n\nmodel = SmallResNet().to(device)\nprint(\"参数量：\", sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\n\n# ===================== 步骤 5：损失、优化器与轮数 [optim] =====================\ncriterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nEPOCHS = 10\n\n# ===================== 步骤 6：把一轮训练写成函数 [train] =====================\n\n\ndef train_one_epoch():\n    model.train()\n    seen, loss_sum, correct = 0, 0.0, 0\n    for xb, yb in train_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        # 前向 → 损失 → 清梯度 → 反向 → 更新\n        logits = model(xb)\n        loss = criterion(logits, yb)\n        optimizer.zero_grad()\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        seen += len(yb)\n        loss_sum += loss.item() * len(yb)\n        correct += (logits.argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n    return loss_sum / seen, correct / seen\n\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef evaluate(m):\n    m.eval()\n    correct, total = 0, 0\n    for xb, yb in test_loader:\n        xb, yb = xb.to(device), yb.to(device)\n        correct += (m(xb).argmax(1) == yb).sum().item()\n        total += len(yb)\n    return correct / total\n\n\nfor epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n    t0 = time.time()\n    train_loss, train_acc = train_one_epoch()\n    test_acc = evaluate(model)\n    print(f\"第 {epoch} 轮  训练准确率 {train_acc:.4f}  测试准确率 {test_acc:.4f}  用时 {time.time() - t0:.1f}s\")\n    log_epoch(epoch, train_loss=train_loss, train_acc=train_acc, test_acc=test_acc, epoch_time=time.time() - t0)\n\n# ===================== 步骤 7：保存检查点：不只是模型 [save] =====================\n# 保存轮数、模型参数和优化器状态\nckpt = {\n    \"epoch\": EPOCHS,\n    \"model\": model.state_dict(),\n    \"optimizer\": optimizer.state_dict(),\n}\ntorch.save(ckpt, \"resnet_ckpt.pt\")\nprint(\"检查点已保存：resnet_ckpt.pt\")\n\n# ===================== 步骤 8：从检查点恢复 [resume] =====================\nmodel2 = SmallResNet().to(device)\noptimizer2 = torch.optim.SGD(model2.parameters(), lr=0.05, momentum=0.9, weight_decay=5e-4)\nsaved = torch.load(\"resnet_ckpt.pt\", map_location=device)\n# 把保存的参数加载进新模型，再恢复优化器状态\nmodel2.load_state_dict(saved[\"model\"])\noptimizer2.load_state_dict(saved[\"optimizer\"])\nstart_epoch = saved[\"epoch\"] + 1\nprint(\"从第\", start_epoch, \"轮继续训练；恢复后的测试准确率：\", evaluate(model2))\n"}]};
